#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:47 index.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kexi; is a database management application. It can be used for creating "
"databases, inserting data, performing queries, and processing data. Forms "
"can be created to provide a custom interface to your data. All database "
"objects - tables, queries and forms - are stored in the database, making it "
"easy to share data and design."
msgstr ""
"&kexi;  je aplikacija za upravljanje bazama podataka. Moze se koristiti za "
"kreiranje baza podataka, ubacivanje podataka, obavljanja upita i obradu "
"podataka. Obrasci se mogu kreirati kako bi pruzili prilagodjeni "
"interfejs(sucelje) vasim podacima. Svi objekti baza podataka - tablice, "
"upiti i obrasci su smjesteni u bazi podataka, sto omogucava lagan prenos "
"podataka i dizajna."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:50
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&kexi; is part of the &calligra; productivity suite for KDE."
msgid "&kexi; is part of the &calligra; productivity suite by KDE."
msgstr "&kexi; je dio &calligra; aplikacijskog seta za KDE."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition to storing your &kexi; databases in files, &kexi; can also store "
"your data on a database server. Using a database server allows you to share "
"your database with other people, and also allows more than one person to use "
"the database at one time. The following database servers are supported by "
"&kexi;:"
msgstr ""
"Kao dodatak snimanju/skladistenju &kexi; baza podataka u datoteke, &kexi; "
"takodjer omogucava snimanje i skladistenje vasih podataka i na serveru baze "
"podataka. Koristeci server, omogucava vam se dijeljenje podataka sa ostalim "
"osobama kao i mogucnost da bazu podataka koristi vise od jedne osobe "
"istovremeno. Sljedeci serveri baza podataka su podrzani u &kexi;:"

#. Tag: ulink
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "MySQL"
msgstr "MySQL"

#. Tag: ulink
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "PostgreSQL"
msgstr "PostgreSQL"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More information about &kexi; can be found at the &kexi; <ulink url=\"http://"
"www.calligra-suite.org/kexi/\">page on the Calligra website</ulink>, and on "
"the <ulink url=\"http://www.kexi-project.org/about.html\">website for Kexi "
"itself</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Više informacija o &kexi; se može pronaći na &kexi; <ulink url=\"http://www."
"calligra-suite.org/kexi/\">stranici Calligra web sajta</ulink>, na <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.kexi-project.org/about.html\">web sajtu za Kexi </ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have any questions about &kexi;, there are two mailing lists you can "
"use. The &kexi; user mailing list can be used to ask questions about using "
"&kexi; or about the &kexi; project. The &kexi; development mailing list can "
"be used to ask questions about the development of &kexi;. Further "
"information on how to subscribe to these lists, together with a few other "
"ways of making contact with &kexi; developers, can be found <ulink url="
"\"http://www.kexi-project.org/support.html\">here</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko imate bilo kakvih pitanja o &kexi; postoje dvije liste koje mozete "
"koristiti. &kexi; korisnicka lista se koristi za postavljanje pitanja o "
"&kexi; ili o &kexi; projektu. &kexi; lista razvoja se koristi za "
"postavljanje pitanja o razvoju &kexi;. Detaljnije informacije kako se "
"pretplatiti na ove liste kao i ostali nacini kontakta &kexi; osoblja se moze "
"pronaci na <ulink url=\"http://www.kexi-project.org/support.html\">here</"
"ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This handbook for &kexi; 2.5 is meant to be based on the &kexi; Handbook for "
"Kexi 1.1. Please coordinate any effort with Jarosław Staniek, email: kexi at "
"kde.org"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj priručnik za &kexi; 2.5 je zasnovan na &kexi; Priručniku za Kexi 1.1. "
"Za informacije ili preporuke mozete se obratiti Jaroslawu Stanieku, email: "
"kexi na kde.org"

