#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Kexi Databases"
msgstr "Kexi baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many applications such as <trademark class=\"registered\">OpenOffice.org</"
"trademark>, <trademark class=\"registered\">LibreOffice</trademark> or "
"<application>&Microsoft; Excel</application> create files which are called "
"documents. &kexi; creates files too, but we refer to them as &kexi; database "
"files, or simple database files here."
msgstr ""
"Mnoge aplikacije poput <trademark class=\"registered\">OpenOffice.org</"
"trademark>, <trademark class=\"registered\">LibreOffice</trademark> ili "
"<application>&Microsoft; Excel</application> kreiraju datoteke koje nazivamo "
"dokumentima. &kexi; takodjer keira datoteke, ali njih nazivamo &kexi; "
"datoteke baza podataka ili jednostavne datoteke baza podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition to storing your databases in database files, &kexi; can also use "
"databases on database servers, which is why we refer to them as database "
"files, and not simply as databases."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno, za pohranjivanje vaših baza podataka u datoteke baza podataka, "
"&kexi; može koristiti baze podataka na server baza podataka te zbog toga, "
"smatramo ih datotekama baza podataka a ne samo bazama podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The term &kexi; project, or simply project is also used to refer to a &kexi; "
"database, regardless of whether it is stored in a file or on a database "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Izraz &kexi; projekat ili samo projekat se takodjer koristi za &kexi; bazu "
"podataka, bez obzira da li je pohranjen u datoteku ili na server baza "
"podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kexi; database files usually have the extension <filename>.kexi</filename>"
msgstr ""
"&kexi; datoteke baza podataka obicno imaju ekstenziju(nastavak) <filename>."
"kexi</filename>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a New Database File"
msgstr "Kreiranje nove datoteke baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Run &kexi;, or if it is already running, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Kexi</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>New... (Ctrl+N)</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Pokrenite &kexi;, ili ukoliko je vec pokrenut, koristite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Kexi</guimenu><guimenuitem>Novi... (Ctrl+N)</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the <guilabel>New Project</guilabel> page, under <guilabel>Blank "
"Projects</guilabel> section, choose <guilabel>Blank Database</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Na stranici <guilabel>Novi Projekat</guilabel>, ispod sekcije "
"<guilabel>Prazni projekti</guilabel>, odaberite <guilabel>Prazna baza "
"podataka</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the <guilabel>Storage Method</guilabel> page, click <guilabel>File</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Na stranici  <guilabel>Metod pohranjivanja</guilabel>, kliknite "
"<guilabel>Datoteka</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the <guilabel>Project Title &amp; Filename</guilabel>, define a title and "
"the filename for the project."
msgstr ""
"Na <guilabel>Naziv projekta &amp; Filename</guilabel>, odaberite ime i naziv "
"datoteke za projekat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click <guilabel>Next</guilabel> to create the project."
msgstr "Kliknite <guilabel>Sljedeće</guilabel> da kreirate projekat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you change the project title, the proposed filename automatically "
"changes accordingly."
msgstr ""
"U skladu s promjenom naziva projekta, automatski se mijenja i predlozeni "
"naziv datoteke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use the file browser to choose a folder where you would like to save "
"your database file."
msgstr ""
"Mozete koristiti preglednik datoteka za odabir foldera u kojem zelite "
"snimiti vasu datoteku baze podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Kexi Main Window"
msgstr "Kexi glavni prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Tabbed Toolbar</guilabel> on the top gives access to common "
"actions and commands."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kartična alatna traka</guilabel>  omogucava pristup cestim "
"akcijama i komandama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Project Navigator</guilabel> and <guilabel>Property Editor</"
"guilabel> are shown in panes on each side of the child window. These can be "
"resized or hidden as required. A pane can be hidden by clicking the small "
"cross at the top of the pane (just below the toolbar)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Navigator projekta</guilabel> i  <guilabel>Uređivač svojstava</"
"guilabel> su prikazani u okviru, po stranama dijete prozora.\n"
"Moguce im je promijeniti velicinu ili sakriti u slucaju potrebe. Okvir se "
"moze sakriti klikom na mali x u vrhu okvira(tacno ispod trake alata)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Database objects (tables, queries, &etc;) listed in the <guilabel>Project "
"Navigator</guilabel> can be opened by clicking (or double-clicking, "
"depending upon your global KDE settings) on their names."
msgstr ""
"Objekti baze podataka(tablice, upiti, &etc;) pobrojani u <guilabel>Navigator "
"projekta</guilabel> mogu se otvoriti klikom(ili duplim klikom, u ovisnosti o "
"vasim KDE postavkama) na njihova imena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main application elements"
msgstr "Elementi glavne aplikacije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main elements of &kexi; application's window are:"
msgstr "Glavni elementi &kexi; prozora aplikacije su:"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Tabbed Toolbar</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Tabbed alatna traka</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Contains available commands for the application. You will find detailed "
"description of any of the commands in <link linkend=\"command-reference"
"\">the appendix</link>."
msgstr ""
"Sadrži dostupne aplikacijske komande. Detaljan opis svake komande mozete "
"pronaći ovdje <link linkend=\"command-reference\">dodatak</link>"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Project Navigator pane</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Okvir navigatora projekta</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Contains a list of any object (tables, queries, forms, ...) created within "
"the currently opened database project. The navigator also contains small "
"toolbar with most usable commands related to the database objects."
msgstr ""
"Sadrzi listu bilo kojeg objekta(tablica, upita, obrazaca, ...) kreiranog "
"unutar trenutno otvorenog projekta baze podataka. Navigator takodjer sadrži "
"malu alatnu traku sa najkorisnijim komandama vezanim za objekte baza "
"podataka."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opened Database Objects Area / Tabbed Windows"
msgstr "Područke otvorenog objekta baze podataka/Kartični prozori"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A central area of the application taking most of the screen space. The user "
"interface contains switchable tabs with windows that are always maximized."
msgstr ""
"Centralno područje aplikacije zauzima najviše mjesta na ekranu. Korisnički "
"interfejs sadrži tablice s kojih se može prebacivati, na prozorima koji su "
"uvijek maksimalnih dimenzija."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Property Editor pane</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Okvir uređivača osobina</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Contains a list of properties of currently activated database object. For "
"certain objects (&eg; form's widgets) it can have several tabs."
msgstr ""
"Sadrži listu osobina trenutno aktivnog objekta baze podataka. Za određene "
"objekte (&eg; kontrole obrasca) može imat više kartica."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Tabbed Toolbar</title>"
msgstr "<title>Kartična alatna traka</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The toolbar is the place that gives you access to most &kexi; commands and "
"actions."
msgstr "Alatna traka vam omogucava pristup većni &kexi; komandi i radnji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the actions found in the different tabs on the toolbar you can:"
msgstr "Koristeci akcije iz razlicitih tabova na alatnoj traci mozete:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create / Open / Close Kexi projects"
msgstr "Kreiraj / Otvori / Zatvori Kexi projekte"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create Database objects"
msgstr "Kreiraj objekte baza podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Import / Export Data"
msgstr "Uvezi / Izvezi podatke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "Depending on the context, additional tabs can be visible:"
msgstr "Ovisno od konteksta, dodatne kartice  mogu biti vidljive:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Form Design</guilabel> tab is visible if the Form Designer is "
"actually used."
msgstr ""
"Kartica <guilabel>Dizajn forme</guilabel> je vidljiva ukoliko se koristi "
"dizajner formi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Report Design</guilabel> tab is visible if the Report Designer is "
"actually used."
msgstr ""
"Kartica <guilabel>Dizajn izvještaja</guilabel> je vidljiva ukoliko se "
"koristi dizajner formi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Project Navigator pane</title>"
msgstr "<title>Okvir navigatora projekta</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Project Navigator</guilabel> pane is one of the most "
"frequently used elements of the &kexi; main window. The pane contains a list "
"of all objects created within the currently opened Kexi database project. "
"The objects are split into groups: tables, queries, forms, reports and "
"scripts."
msgstr ""
"Okvir <guilabel>Navigator projekta</guilabel> je jedan od najčešće "
"korištenih elemenata u &kexi; glavnom prozoru. Okvir sadrži liste objekata "
"kreiranih unutar trenutno otvorenog Kexi projekta baza podataka. Objekti su "
"podijeljeni u grupe: tablice, upiti, forme, izvještaji i skripte."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Project Navigator pane also contains a small toolbar for most frequently "
"used commands (from left to right): <guilabel>Open</guilabel> selected "
"object, <guilabel>Design</guilabel> selected object, and <guilabel>Delete</"
"guilabel> selected object."
msgstr ""
"Navigator projekta također sadrži male alatne trake za komande koje se "
"najčešće upotrebljavaju(s lijeva na desno): <guilabel>Otvori</guilabel> "
"selektirani objekat, <guilabel>Dizajniraj</guilabel> selektirani objekat i "
"<guilabel>Obriši</guilabel> selektirani objekat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each object on the list a context menu is available using the right "
"mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Za svaki objekat na listi, dostupan je kontekst meni koristeći desni klik "
"miša."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Double clicking with the left mouse button on the object's name on the list "
"opens the object in <guilabel>Data View</guilabel>. If the object's window "
"was already opened, the action just activates the window without switching "
"it's view mode."
msgstr ""
"Duplim klikom miša na naziv objekta u listi otvara se objekat u  "
"<guilabel>Pregled podataka</guilabel>. Ako je prozor objekta već otvoren, "
"dvostruki klik miša jednostavno aktivira prozor bez prebacivanja načina "
"prikaza."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Even though your operating system or window manager may be set up to handle "
"single clicks instead of double clicks, &kexi; uses double clicks in "
"<guilabel>Project Navigator</guilabel> to avoid accidentally opening large "
"datasets or executing queries."
msgstr ""
"Čak i ukoliko je vaš operativni sistem ili prozorski menadžer podešen na rad "
"sa jednim klikom umjesto duplim, &kexi; koristi duple klikove u "
"<guilabel>Navigatoru projekta</guilabel> da bi se izbjeglo slučajno "
"otvaranje velikih kolekcija podataka ili izvršavanja upita."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opened database objects area / Tabbed Windows"
msgstr "Oblasti otvorenih objekata baza podataka / Prozori s karticama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whenever you double click an object in the project navigator, it opens in "
"the <guilabel>Opened database objects area</guilabel>. Each window has its "
"own tab in &kexi;."
msgstr ""
"Svaki dupli klik na objekat u navigatoru projekta, ima za posljedicu "
"otvaranje  <guilabel>Oblasti otvorenih objekata baza podataka</guilabel>. "
"Svaki prozor ima svoju vlastitu karticu u &kexi;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can rearrange the tabs by drag and drop and close them using the "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-tab-close.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> button located at the "
"far right of the tab strip."
msgstr ""
"Možete preurediti raspored kartica njihovim prevlačenjem i zatvarati ih "
"koristeći <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-tab-"
"close.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> dugme koje "
"se nalazi krajnje desno na traci kartica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometime later on there will be an option to detach tabs, creating somewhat "
"something similar to an MDI interface. That could be useful for custom "
"solutions or multiple displays."
msgstr ""
"Planirana je opcija odvajanja kartica, čime bi se postiglo nešto slično MDI "
"interfejsu. To bi moglo biti veoma korisno za pojedina rješenja i više "
"monitora."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Property Editor pane</title>"
msgstr "<title>Okvir uređivača osobina</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Property Editor</guilabel> pane you can change properties "
"of the object displayed in the active window. Depending on the context, the "
"pane is consisted of one or more tabs. The first, always visible tab, "
"<guilabel>Properties</guilabel>, contains the list of available properties."
msgstr ""
"U okviru <guilabel>Uređivač osobina</guilabel> možete mijenjati osobine "
"objekta prikazanog u aktivnom prozoru. Ovisno o kontekstu, okvir sadrži "
"jednu ili više kartica. Prva, uvijek vidljiva kartica,  <guilabel>Osobine</"
"guilabel>, sadrži listu dostupnih osobina."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules for using the <guilabel>Property Editor</guilabel>:"
msgstr "Pravila za korištenje  <guilabel>Uređivača osobina</guilabel>:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid "Each row contains a single property."
msgstr "Svaki red sadrži jednu osobinu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use the mouse or the keyboard to change values of particular "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Možete koristiti miš ili tataturu za promjenu vrijednosti pojedinih osobina."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Most frequently used types of property values are:"
msgstr "Najčešće korišteni tipovi vrijednosti osobina su:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"a number; you can enter the value directly or increase or decrease its value "
"by clicking with the left mouse button on the arrows."
msgstr ""
"number; možete unijeti vrijednost direktno ili povećavati/smanjivati "
"vrijednost lijevim klikom miša  na strelice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid "text"
msgstr "tekst"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "drop down list of values"
msgstr "padajuća lista vrijednosti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes/No; you can toggle the value by clicking on the button; Yes (true) means "
"that the button is toggled on, No (false) means that the button is toggled "
"off."
msgstr ""
"Yes/No; možete mijenjati vrijednost klikom na dugme; Da(tačno) znači da je "
"dugme pritisnuto, Ne(netačno) ima značenje da dugme nije pritisnuto."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is no need to confirm a changed value: changes are visible immediately "
"after moving to a different row of the Property Editor's list or by pressing "
"the &Enter; key."
msgstr ""
"Nema potrebe za potvrdom izmjene vrijednosti: promjene su vidljive odmah po "
"prelasku na drugi red u listi uređivača osobina ili pritiskom na tipku "
"&Enter;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Names of the recently changed properties that not yet were stored in the "
"database are marked with bold text."
msgstr ""
"Imena nedavno izmijenjenih osobina, koja još uvijek nisu pohranjena u bazu "
"podataka su markirana zadebljanim tekstom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After changing the value of a property, a special <guilabel>Undo changes</"
"guilabel> button appears on the right side of the Property Editor's list. By "
"clicking it you can revert the value of the property to the original value "
"that was loaded from the database upon opening the database object. The "
"button is only visible when the property is actually highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Nakon izmjene vrijednosti osobine, pojavljuje se specijalno "
"<guilabel>Undo(poništi) promjene</guilabel>  dugme u listi uređivača "
"osobina. Klikom na pomenuto dugme možete vratiti vrijednost na originalnu "
"vrijednost osobine, dobijenu iz baze podataka prilikom otvaranja objekta "
"baze podataka. Dugme je vidljivo samo kada je neka osobina istaknuta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Property Editor</guilabel> pane is empty if:"
msgstr "Okvir <guilabel>Uređivač osobina</guilabel> je prazan ukoliko:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "no single database object's window is opened, or"
msgstr "nijedan prozor objekta baze podataka nije otvoren, ili"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"the active database object's window does not offer properties; it is usually "
"the case when it is opened in <guilabel>Data View</guilabel> instead of "
"<guilabel>Design View</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"aktivni prozor objekta bate podataka ne nudi osobine; ovo je najčešće slučaj "
"kada je otvoren u <guilabel>Pregled podataka</guilabel> umjesto "
"<guilabel>Pregled dizajna</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening an existing Kexi database file"
msgstr "Otvaranje postojeće Kexi datoteke baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are two ways to open an existing &kexi; database file:"
msgstr ""
"Postoje dva načina za otvaranje postojeće &kexi; datoteke baze podataka:"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening a database file in the Open Project dialog"
msgstr "Otvaranje datoteke baza podataka u prozoru Otvori projekat"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Run &kexi;. You should see the <guilabel>Welcome to Kexi</guilabel> startup "
"dialog, which allows you select one of the recently used projects to open."
msgstr ""
"Pokrenite &kexi; Vidjet ćete <guilabel>Dobrodošli u Kexi</guilabel> početni "
"prozor koji vam omogućava otvaranje nekog od nedavno korištenih projekata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the project is not on the page with recently used projects choose "
"<guibutton>Open...</guibutton> (<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</"
"keycap></keycombo>). You will see the following dialog:"
msgstr ""
"Ako se projekat ne nalazi na strani sa nedavno korištenim projektima, "
"odaberite <guibutton>Otvori...</guibutton>(<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>). Prikazat će vam se sljedeći prozor:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the location bar, pick a folder containing a file you are looking for."
msgstr ""
"Iz lokacijske trake odaberite folder koji sadrži datoteku koju tražite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can either pick a file which is immediately opened. Alternatively you "
"enter its name in the <guilabel>Name:</guilabel> box and click on "
"<guilabel>Next</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati opciju odabira imena datoteke koja onda smjesta otvara ili "
"možete unijeti njeno ime u <guilabel>Ime:</guilabel>  i kliknuti na  "
"<guilabel>Sljedeće</guilabel>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:329 index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Bilješke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default the <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> drop down list has <guilabel>All "
"Supported Files (*.kexi, *.kexic, *.kexis, *.mdb)</guilabel> selected. In "
"case the file you are looking for has another extension, you can change the "
"selection of the <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> drop down list to "
"<guilabel>All Files</guilabel> to display all available files (regardless of "
"an extension)."
msgstr ""
"Po običaju  <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel>  padajuća lista  ima selektovano  "
"<guilabel>Svi podržane datoteke (*.kexi, *.kexic, *.kexis, *.mdb)</"
"guilabel>. U slučaju da datoteka koju tražite ima neku drugu ekstenziju, "
"možete promijeniti selekciju  <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel>  padajuće liste "
"na <guilabel>Sve datoteke</guilabel> čime ćete odabrati prikaz svih "
"datoteka(neovisno o njihovoj ekstenziji)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have selected a file of an external type, like a <guilabel>MS Access</"
"guilabel> <filename>.mdb</filename> file, &kexi; will provide you with the "
"option to import the file."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste odabrali datoteku eksternog tipa kao što je <guilabel>MS Access</"
"guilabel> <filename>.mdb</filename>  datoteka, &kexi; će vam omogućiti "
"opciju uvoza datoteke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have selected a connection data file (with <filename>.kexic</"
"filename> extension) or a shortcut to a project on database server file "
"(with <filename>.kexis</filename> extension), &kexi; will display "
"appropriate dialogs."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste odabrali connection data file(sa <filename>.kexic</filename>  "
"ekstenzijom) ili prečicu neke datoteke na serveru baza podataka(sa "
"<filename>.kexis</filename>  ekstenzijom) &kexi; će vam prikazati prikladne "
"dijaloge."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening an existing Kexi database file by clicking on .kexi file's icon"
msgstr ""
"Otvaranje postojeće Kexi datoteke baza podataka klikajući na ikonu .kexi "
"datoteke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:339
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click file's icon using your file manager or desktop. &kexi; will open this "
"database project automatically."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikonu datoteke putem upravitelja datoteka ili na desktopu. &kexi; "
"će automatski otvoriti taj projekat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note about database files accessed remotely. You may want to open a database "
"file that is located on a remote source (&eg; a web or FTP server or a MS "
"Windows network share). KDE allows you to open files from remote sources "
"directly in applications and to save changes back to the source, but this is "
"not the case with database files. By clicking on a database file located on "
"a remote source, a copy of the file will be downloaded to a temporary "
"directory on your computer and all your changes will be made to this local "
"file. The remote original of the file will remain unchanged, so it's "
"recommended to copy (download) the file to your computer first, then open "
"the file and copy it back to the remote source if you want to make it up to "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Napomena vezana za daljinski pristup datotekama baza podataka. Možda ćete "
"trebati otvoriti datoteku baze podataka koja je locirana na udaljenom "
"izvoru(&eg; mreži, FTP serveru ili MS Windows dijeljenoj mreži). KDE vam "
"inače omogućava otvaranje datoteka iz udaljenih izvora direktno u "
"aplikacijama te snimanje promjena na izvoru, ali kada je riječ o datotekama "
"baza podataka, to nije slučaj. Klikajući na datoteku baze podataka koja se "
"nalazi na udaljenom izvoru, kopija izvorne datoteke će biti pohranjena na "
"vašem računaru i sve promjene će biti odražene samo na ovoj datoteci. "
"Udaljena datoteka će ostati nepromijenjena stoga se preporučuje da, ukoliko "
"datoteku također želite promijeniti i na udaljenom izvoru, potrebno je da "
"kopirate datoteku na vaš računar i da je nakon željenih izmjena, kopirate "
"opet na udaljeni izvor."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using built-in help"
msgstr "Koristeći ugrađenu pomoć"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following ways to get built-in help in &kexi; are available:"
msgstr "Na sljedeće načine možete dobiti ugrađenu pomoć u &kexi;:"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Handbook in form of electronic document."
msgstr "Priručnik u elektronskoj formi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Handbook is available by pressing <keycap>F1</keycap> key or click "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-help-contents.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> in the menubar and "
"select <guilabel>Help</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Priručnik može biti prikazan pritiskom na <keycap>F1</keycap> tipku ili "
"klikom na  <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-help-"
"contents.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> u traci "
"sa menijima, a potom odaberite <guilabel>Pomoć</guilabel>."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>What's This?</emphasis> hints."
msgstr "<emphasis>Šta je ovo?</emphasis> savjeti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <guilabel>What's This?</guilabel> from the menu that pops up when you "
"click <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-help-"
"contents.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> and then "
"click on an area of the application to get hints about it."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite <guilabel>Šta je ovo</guilabel> iz menija koji iskoči kada "
"kliknete <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-help-"
"contents.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> , a "
"potom kliknite na područje aplikacije da dobijete savjete vezane za istu."

