#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:392
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To learn the basics of &kexi;, you could build a simple database utilizing "
"most elementary &kexi;'s features. To make things simpler, advanced database "
"design topics will not be covered here."
msgstr ""
"Da bi naučili osnove &kexi; mogli biste napraviti jednostavnu bazu podataka "
"koristeći neke osnovne mogućnosti &kexi;ja. U svrhu pojednostavljenja "
"stvari, teme o naprednom dizajnu baza podataka se ovdje neće spominjati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start by creating a new empty Phone Book."
msgstr "Počnite sa kreiranjem novog, praznog telefonskog imenika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid "Having a new empty database project, perform the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"Nakon kreiranja praznog projekta baza podataka, odradite sljedeće korake:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Design database tables. Read the section called <link linkend=\"designing-"
"database-tables\">Designing Database Tables</link>."
msgstr ""
"Dizajnirajte tablice baze podataka. Pročitajte poglavlje pod nazivom <link "
"linkend=\"designing-database-tables\">Dizajniranje tablica baza podataka</"
"link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter data into tables. Read the section called <link linkend=\"entering-"
"data-into-tables\">Entering Data Into Tables</link>."
msgstr ""
"Unesite podatke u tablicu. Pročitajte poglavlje pod nazivom  <link linkend="
"\"entering-data-into-tables\">Unos podataka u tablice</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:401
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Design database queries. Read the section called <link linkend=\"designing-"
"database-queries\">Designing Database Queries</link>."
msgstr ""
"Dizajnirajte upite baza podataka. Pročitajte poglavlje pod nazivom <link "
"linkend=\"designing-database-queries\">Dizajniranje upita baza podataka</"
"link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Design forms. Read the section called <link linkend=\"designing-forms"
"\">Designing Forms</link>."
msgstr ""
"Dizajnirajte formu. Pročitajte poglavlje pod nazivom  <link linkend="
"\"designing-forms\">Dizajniranje formi</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use forms to enter data. Read the section called <link linkend=\"entering-"
"data-using-forms\">Entering Data Using Forms</link>."
msgstr ""
"Koristite formu za unos podataka. Pročitajte poglavlje pod nazivom <link "
"linkend=\"entering-data-using-forms\">Unos podataka koristeći forme</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid "Designing Database Tables"
msgstr "Dizajniranje tablica baza podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First, there will be two tables added to your database: "
"<replaceable>Persons</replaceable> and <replaceable>Phones</replaceable>. "
"These are exactly the same tables as described in chapter <link linkend="
"\"database-and-spreadsheet\">Database and Spreadsheet</link>. A layout for "
"<replaceable>Persons</replaceable> can be found in section <link linkend="
"\"data-integrity-and-validity\">Data integrity and validity</link> in that "
"chapter."
msgstr ""
"Prvo, bit će dvije tabele dodate u vašu bazu podataka: <replaceable>Osobe</"
"replaceable> i <replaceable>Telefoni</replaceable>. To su upravo iste tabele "
"kao što su opisane u poglavlju <link linkend=\"database-and-spreadsheet"
"\">Baza podataka i tablice</link>. Raspored za <replaceable>osobe</"
"replaceable> može se naći u sekciji <link linkend=\"data-integrity-and-"
"validity\">Integritet podataka i validnost</link> u ovom poglavlju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <guilabel>Table</guilabel> from the toolbar. You can also use "
"<guilabel>Create object: table</guilabel> in the context menu of the "
"<guilabel>Tables</guilabel> item in the Project Navigator."
msgstr ""
"Selektirajte <guilabel>Tablica</guilabel> iz alatne trake. Također možete "
"koristiti <guilabel>Napravi objekat: tablica</guilabel> u kontekstnom meniju "
"od <guilabel>Tablica</guilabel> stavke u navigatoru projekta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Table Designer's window will appear. Looking at the top of designer's "
"window you will notice that &kexi; proposed you a generic name like "
"<guilabel>Table1</guilabel> for the new table. The table design is not saved "
"yet so you will be able to assign more proper name later. Moreover, because "
"of the same reason, the table name is not yet visible in the "
"<guilabel>Project Navigator</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Pojaviće se prozor dizajnera tablice. Ako pogledate vrh prozora, primijetit "
"ćete da vam je &kexi; predložio generički naziv tablice poput "
"<guilabel>Tablica1</guilabel> za novu tablicu. Dizajn tablice još uvijek "
"nije snimljen što vam omogućava odabir pogodnijeg imena naknadno. Štaviše, "
"iz istog razloga, niti naziv tablice još uvijek nije vidljiv u  "
"<guilabel>Navigatoru projekta</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Table Designer window"
msgstr "Prozor dizajnera tablice"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid "Table Designer window consists of following columns:"
msgstr "Prozor dizajnera talbice sadrži sljedeće kolone:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:417
#, no-c-format
msgid "- Additional Information about the field."
msgstr "Dodatne informacije o polju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Field Caption</guilabel> - caption of the field which will be "
"displayed during data entering."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Naslov polja</guilabel> - naslov polja koji će biti prikazan tokom "
"unosa podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:419
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Data Type</guilabel> - a combo box containing a list of data "
"types, allowing to set a main rule for entered data for a given field. For "
"example, when an integer number data type is set for a field, a database "
"user will not able to enter letter characters into this field."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tip podatka</guilabel> - kombinovani okvir  koji sadrži listu "
"tipova podataka te time omogućava postavljanje pravila o unosu podataka u "
"odabrano polje. Npr. ukoliko se za tip podatka nekog polja odabere cijeli "
"broj, korisnik baze podataka neće biti u mogućnosti unositi slova u ovo "
"polje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Comments</guilabel> - you can enter here any information useful "
"for understanding what the given field is provided for. This additional text "
"will be saved within the table design and only visible in design mode."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Komentari</guilabel> možete unijeti bilo kakvu informaciju korisnu "
"za razumijevanje svrhe nekog polja. Ovaj dodatni tekst će biti snimljen "
"unutar dizajna tablice i bit će vidljiv samo unutar dizajner načina rada."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the Table designer window, every row corresponds to a single table field. "
"You can recognize you are in design mode because the <guilabel>Design</"
"guilabel> button is toggled on within the Table designer window toolbar."
msgstr ""
"U prozoru dizajnera tablice, svaki red predstavlja jedno polje tablice. "
"Možete prepoznati da ste u dizejnerskom modu(načinu rada) zbog toga što je, "
"na alatnoj traci,  uključeno <guilabel>Dizajn</guilabel> dugme."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:425
#, no-c-format
msgid "Designing the Persons table"
msgstr "Dizajniranje tablice Osoba"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the first row click on the cell in the <guilabel>Field Caption</guilabel> "
"column and enter <replaceable>Name</replaceable> as field caption. Filling "
"the <guilabel>Field Caption</guilabel> field automatically fills the "
"<guilabel>Name</guilabel> field as seen in the <guilabel>Property Editor</"
"guilabel> pane."
msgstr ""
"U prvom redu kliknite na ćeliju u koloni <guilabel>Naslov polja</guilabel> i "
"unesite <replaceable>Ime</replaceable> kao naslov polja. Popunjavajući  "
"polje <guilabel>Naslov polja</guilabel>, automatski se popunjava i "
"polje<guilabel>Ime</guilabel> što je vidljivo u <guilabel>Uređivaču osobina</"
"guilabel> prozorskom oknu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notes about field names and captions"
msgstr "Napomene o imenu i naslovu polja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every table field must have a name and a caption, these cannot be empty."
msgstr "Svako polje mora imati ime i naslov tj. ne mogu ostati prazni."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Field name is a word used by the database, usually not visible for users of "
"the database application. The name may not contain special (national) "
"characters (like ±, ¶, Ü) or space characters. The name must only contain "
"roman letters, numbers and underscore sign <quote>_</quote>. Use the latter "
"instead of spaces or dashes."
msgstr ""
"Ime polja je riječ koja se koristi u bazi podataka, obično nevidljiva "
"korisnicima aplikacije. Ime ne smije sadržavati specijalne(nacionalne) "
"karaktere poput (±, ¶, Ü) ili razmake. Ime smije sadržavati samo rimska "
"slova, brojeve i donju crtu <quote>_</quote>. Koristite crticu umjesto "
"razmaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Field names must be started with a letter or underscore sign <quote>_</"
"quote>, never with a number."
msgstr ""
"Imena polja moraju počinjati sa slovom ili donjom crtom sign <quote>_</"
"quote>, a nikada brojem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It does not matter whether you are using small or capital letters. For "
"&kexi; the field name <replaceable>Persons</replaceable> is the same as "
"<replaceable>persons</replaceable>."
msgstr ""
"Nije bitno koristite li mala ili velika slova. Za &kexi;,  ime polja  "
"<replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> je isto kao i <replaceable>osobe</"
"replaceable>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Field caption, on the other hand, allows you to enter any letters and "
"special characters. It will be displayed for users of the database "
"application."
msgstr ""
"S druge strane, za naslov polja smijete koristiti bilo koja slova ili "
"specijalne karaktere. Naslov polja će biti prikazan korisnicima aplikacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid "In a similar way, enter the following fields into the table design:"
msgstr "Na sličan način, unesite sljedeća polja u dizajn tablice:"

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:440
#, no-c-format
msgid "surname"
msgstr "prezime"

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid "street"
msgstr "ulica"

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid "house_number"
msgstr "broj_fiksnog"

#. Tag: replaceable
#: index.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid "city"
msgstr "grad"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All the above fields, except <replaceable>house_number</replaceable>, are of "
"type text. Change <replaceable>house_number</replaceable> field's type to "
"integer number. To do this, click on a cell in the <guilabel>Data Type</"
"guilabel> column, <replaceable>house_number</replaceable> row and then click "
"on drop down list's button or press <keycap>F4</keycap>. The list of data "
"types will appear. You can also use the arrow keys <keysym>Up</keysym> and "
"<keysym>Down</keysym> to select another type. Select the <guilabel>Integer "
"Number</guilabel> type."
msgstr ""
"Sva gore pobrojana polja su tekstualnog tipa, osim "
"<replaceable>broj_fiksnog</replaceable>. Promijenite tip polja "
"<replaceable>broj_fiksnog</replaceable> u cijeli broj. Da biste ovo uradili, "
"kliknite na  <guilabel>Tip podatka</guilabel> kolonu,  "
"<replaceable>broj_fiksnog</replaceable> red a zatim kliknite na dugme "
"padajuće liste ili pritisnite  <keycap>F4</keycap> tipku. Pojavit će se "
"lista tipova podataka. Možete također koristiti strelice na tastaturi "
"<keysym>Up</keysym> i <keysym>Down</keysym> za odabir tipa. Odaberite tip  "
"<guilabel>Cijeli broj</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From now on, the <replaceable>house_number</replaceable> field only accepts "
"numbers."
msgstr ""
"Od sada, polje  <replaceable>broj_fiksnog</replaceable> će prihvatati samo "
"brojeve."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:449
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Persons table design is ready. Click the <guilabel>Data</guilabel> button on "
"the toolbar to finish designing and switch to <guilabel>Data View</guilabel> "
"for the table. This allows you to enter data into the table."
msgstr ""
"Dizajn tablice osobe je gotov. Kliknite na dugme <guilabel>Podaci</"
"guilabel>  u alatnoj traci da biste završili dizajniranje i prebacili se na  "
"<guilabel>Pregled podataka</guilabel> za tablicu. Ovo vam omogućava unos "
"podataka u tablicu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As the design is not yet saved in the database, the <guilabel>Save Object "
"As</guilabel> dialog window appears. You need to specify the name for the "
"new table."
msgstr ""
"Kako dizajn još uvijek nije snimljen u bazi podataka, pojaviće se "
"<guilabel>Snimi objekat kao</guilabel> prozor. Trebate specificirati ime za "
"novu tablicu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kexi; offers a generic name like <guilabel>Table1</guilabel>. To change the "
"name, enter <replaceable>Persons</replaceable> into the <guilabel>Caption</"
"guilabel> field and press the &Enter; key or click the <keycap>OK</keycap> "
"button. The <guilabel>Caption</guilabel> field will be used to display the "
"table to database end-users, &eg; as a form. Unlike the name, the caption "
"can contain any characters including spaces and special characters."
msgstr ""
"&kexi; nudi generičko ime poput <guilabel>Tablica1</guilabel>. Da "
"promijenite ime, unesite <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> u polje "
"<guilabel>Naslov</guilabel> i pritisnite tipku &Enter;  ili kliknite na "
"dugme  <keycap>OK</keycap>. <guilabel>Naslov</guilabel> će se koristiti za "
"prikaz tablice krajnjim korisnicima baze podataka, &eg; kao forma. Za "
"razliku od imena, naslov može sadržavati bilo koje karaktere uključujući "
"razmake i specijalne karaktere."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that filling the <guilabel>Caption</guilabel> field automatically fills "
"the <guilabel>Name</guilabel> field. For your convenience the rule for using "
"only letters, numbers and the <quote>_</quote> character is kept. You can "
"alter the contents of the <guilabel>Name</guilabel> field if you want to."
msgstr ""
"Primijetite da polje <guilabel>Naslov</guilabel> automatski popunjava polje "
"<guilabel>Ime</guilabel>.  Zbog vaše pogodnosti, pravilo o korištenju "
"isključivo slova, brojeva i  <quote>_</quote> ostaje na snazi. Možete "
"promijeniti sadržaj polja <guilabel>Ime</guilabel> ukoliko želite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are asked about an agreement for automatic adding of primary key to the "
"table. Click <guilabel>Add primary key</guilabel> button to continue."
msgstr ""
"Pitani ste o dogovoru za automatsko dodavanje primarnog ključa. Kliknite na "
"dugme <guilabel>Dodaj primarni ključ</guilabel> za nastavak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <replaceable>Persons</replaceable> table has been created and opened in "
"Data View. Its name appears in the <guilabel>Project Navigator</guilabel> "
"pane."
msgstr ""
"Tablica <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> je kreirana i otvorena u prikazu "
"podataka. Njeno se ime pojavljuje u prozorskom okviru <guilabel>Navigator "
"projekta</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create the <replaceable>Phones</replaceable> table, in a similar way as "
"<replaceable>Persons</replaceable> table."
msgstr ""
"Kreirajte tablicu <replaceable>Telefoni</replaceable>  na sličan način kao "
"<replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> table."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:461
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create a <replaceable>person</replaceable> field of type <guilabel>Integer</"
"guilabel> number and <replaceable>phone</replaceable> of type "
"<guilabel>Text</guilabel>. Do not use a number type here because phone "
"numbers can have many different forms and prefixes."
msgstr ""
"Kreirajte polje <replaceable>osoba</replaceable> table tipa <guilabel>Cijeli "
"broj</guilabel> i polje <replaceable>telefon</replaceable> tipa "
"<guilabel>Tekst</guilabel>. Nemojte koristiti brojčani tip za brojeve "
"telefona jer oni mogu imati mnogo različitih oblika i prefiksa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guilabel>Data</guilabel> button on the toolbar and enter "
"<replaceable>Phones</replaceable> caption for the table. As for your "
"previous table, allow &kexi; to automatically create a primary key."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na dugme <guilabel>Podaci</guilabel> i na alatnoj traci unesite "
"<replaceable>Telefoni</replaceable> za  naslov tablice. Kao i u prethodnoj "
"tablici, omogućite &kexi;ju da automatski kreira primarni ključ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:467
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering Data Into Tables"
msgstr "Unošenje podataka u tablice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:468
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have designed the two tables <replaceable>Persons</replaceable> and "
"<replaceable>Phones</replaceable>. None of them contain any data yet. You "
"can enter some, and in this chapter you will learn how to do this fast and "
"effectively."
msgstr ""
"Dizajnirali ste dvije tablice <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> i "
"<replaceable>Telefoni</replaceable>. Nijedna još uvijek ne sadrži podatke. "
"Možete probati unijeti neke podatke, a u ovom poglavlju ćete naučiti kako to "
"uraditi brzo i efektivno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Start with the <replaceable>Persons</replaceable> table. Open it in Data "
"View using <guilabel>Open</guilabel> in the <guilabel>Project Navigator's</"
"guilabel> context menu or the toolbar button. The current cell is marked "
"with (usually black) thicker border, a cell cursor. The contents of the "
"cell, if present, are highlighted with a different color. The current row, "
"&ie; the one you have placed your rectangular cursor in, is marked on the "
"left hand with an arrow symbol."
msgstr ""
"Počnite sa tablicom <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable>. Otvorite je u Prikaz "
"podataka načinu, koristeći <guilabel>Otvori</guilabel> u <guilabel>Navigator "
"projekta</guilabel> kontekstnom meniju ili dugmetu na alatnoj traci. "
"Trenutna ćelija je prepoznatljiva po podebljanom okviru (obično crnom bojom) "
"i kursoru ćelije. Sadržaj ćelije, ukoliko postoji, su istaknuti drukčijom "
"bojom. Trenutni red, &ie;  jeste onaj u koji ste stavili vaš trokutasti "
"kursor i markiran je simbolom strelice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can navigate through table cells using the arrow keys, <keycap>Page "
"Down</keycap>, <keycap>Page Down</keycap>, <keycap>Home</keycap>, "
"<keycap>End</keycap> keys; you can also click with the mouse in a cell to "
"select it."
msgstr ""
"Možete se kretati kroz ćelije tablice koristeći <keycap>Page Down</keycap>, "
"<keycap>Page Down</keycap>, <keycap>Home</keycap>, <keycap>End</keycap> "
"tipke. Također možete kliknuti mišem na ćeliju i selektovati je."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:474
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Initially, after opening the table <replaceable>Persons</replaceable>, the "
"cursor is placed in the <replaceable>Id</replaceable> column. The column has "
"autonumber property defined, marked with blue (autonumber) text in the last "
"row. It means you do not have to enter values there by hand when entering "
"data for a new row because the cell will be filled automatically with "
"successive numbers."
msgstr ""
"Inicijalno, po otvaranju tablice <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable>, kursor je "
"postavljen na <replaceable>Id</replaceable> kolonu.\n"
"Kolona ima definisan automatski broj, označen plavim tekstom u posljednjem "
"redu. To znači da prilikom unosa podataka za novi red, ne morate unositi "
"vrijednost ručno, jer će ćelija biti automatski popunjena sa slijedećim "
"brojem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Inserting new rows and entering data for them in &kexi; is different from "
"the way of doing this in spreadsheets. To enter data for a new row, you need "
"to use the arrow keys or mouse, to move your cursor to the special empty "
"last row marked with a plus sign. Place your cursor in the (second) "
"<replaceable>name</replaceable> column and enter a person's name. Also enter "
"surname, street, house number and city. When done, move the cell cursor to "
"the last empty row either by using the <keycap>Down</keycap> key or by "
"clicking in the last row with the mouse to append a new row."
msgstr ""
"Umetanje novih redova i unos podataka u &kexi; je drukčije u odnosu na isti "
"postupak za tabelarni prikaz. Da bi unijeli podatke za novi red, potrebno je "
"da koristite tipke sa strelicama ili miš, tako da pomjerite kursor na "
"posljednji red označen sa znakom plus. Pozicionirajte kursor u (drugu) "
"kolonu <replaceable>ime</replaceable> i unesite ime osobe. Također unesite "
"prezime, ulicu, broj adrese i grad. Po završteku, pomjerite kursor ćelije na "
"posljednji prazni red, bilo da kliknete tipku <keycap>Dole</keycap>  ili da "
"mišem kliknete na posljednji red u svrhu otvaranja novog reda."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:478
#, no-c-format
msgid "Details About Actions Available While Entering Data Into Tables"
msgstr "Detalji o akcijama su dostupni dok se podaci unose u tablice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:480
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As soon as you enter the first character, the current row is being edited. A "
"pencil symbol appears on the left side of the data table."
msgstr ""
"Čim unesete prvi karakter, trenutni red započinje sa uređivanjem. Simbol "
"olovke će se pojaviti na lijevoj strani tablice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Double clicking a cell with the left mouse button or pressing &Enter; or the "
"<keycap>F2</keycap> key also starts editing of the current row."
msgstr ""
"Dupli klik miša na ćeliju ili pritisak tipke &Enter; ili <keycap>F2</keycap> "
"također pokreće uređivanje trenutnog reda."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:482
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing the &Esc; key when the contents of a cell is edited cancels changes "
"made to this cell. However, the pencil symbol will not disappear because you "
"can still move to a different cell of the edited row to change its contents. "
"To cancel changes made to the entire edited row, press the &Esc; key again."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskom na tipku &Esc; u toku izmjene sadržaja ćelije se poništavaju "
"promjene napravljene nad ovom ćelijom. Međutim, simbol olovke neće nestati "
"jer se još uvijek možete kretati i izmjenjivati druge ćelije u redu koji se "
"uređuje. Da bi poništili promjene nad čitavim redom, pritisnite &Ecs; tipku "
"ponovno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:483
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instead of pressing the &Esc; key, you can click the <guilabel>Cancel Record "
"Changes</guilabel> toolbar button."
msgstr ""
"Umjesto pritiskanja &Esc; tipke, možete kliknuti na dugme  <guilabel>Otkaži "
"promjene</guilabel> u alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:484
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the <keycombo>&Shift;&Enter;</keycombo> keys to accept changes made to "
"all cells in the currently edited row."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite <keycombo>&Shift;&Enter;</keycombo> kombinaciju tipki da biste "
"prihvatili promjene u svim ćelijama u trenutno uređivanom redu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:486
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Fill the <replaceable>Phones</replaceable> table with data. In the "
"<replaceable>person</replaceable> column you need to provide an "
"<replaceable>Id</replaceable> number of the person existing in the "
"<replaceable>Persons</replaceable> table."
msgstr ""
"Popunite tablicu <replaceable>Telefoni</replaceable> sa podacima. U  "
"koloni<replaceable>osoba</replaceable> potrebno je navesti <replaceable>Id</"
"replaceable> broj postojeće osobe u tablici <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid "Designing Database Queries"
msgstr "Dizajniranje upita baza podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:491
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A database's primary purpose is to store and help extract information you "
"are looking for. Unlike databases written on a paper sheets, &kexi; database "
"allows you to specify more search criteria. Results are returned faster even "
"for large data sets. All this is a power of databases, however to be able to "
"perform effective queries in your database, you need to learn how to tell "
"the database what you are looking for."
msgstr ""
"Svrha baza podataka je smještanje i pomoć pri dobijanju informacije koja vas "
"interesuje. Za razliku od baza podataka pisanih na papiru, &kexi; vam "
"dopušta da specificirate veći kriterij pretrage. Rezultati su dobijeni brže "
"čak i za velik broj podataka. Sve ovo je moć baza podataka, međutim da bi "
"omogućili efektivne upite u bazama podataka, morate naučiti kako da "
"saopštite bazi podataka ono za čim tragate."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:493
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With database queries you can limit data coming from a table to a predefined "
"set of rows and columns as well as dynamically join data coming from "
"multiple tables."
msgstr ""
"Sa upitima baza podataka možete ograničiti saobraćaj dolaznih podataka iz "
"tabllice u predefinisani set redova i kolona, kao i dinamički pridružiti "
"nadolazeće podatke iz više tablica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To see how queries work in practice you will create a contacts query joining "
"data from two tables: <replaceable>Persons</replaceable> and "
"<replaceable>Phones</replaceable> (designed <link linkend=\"designing-"
"database-tables\">here</link> and filled with data <link linkend=\"entering-"
"data-into-tables\">here</link>)."
msgstr ""
"Da biste vidjeli kako upiti rade u praksi, kreirat ćete upit imenika, "
"spajajući podatke iz dvije tablice: <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> i  "
"<replaceable>Telefoni</replaceable> (dizajnirani <link linkend=\"designing-"
"database-tables\">ovdje</link> i napunjeni podacima <link linkend=\"entering-"
"data-into-tables\">odavdje</link>)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:498
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create a new empty query by selecting <guilabel>Query</guilabel> from the "
"toolbar. The design window will appear. The window is split into two areas: "
"query relationships at the top and query columns below."
msgstr ""
"Kreirajte novi prazni upit selektirajući <guilabel>Upit</guilabel> iz alatne "
"trake. Prozor dizajnera će se pojaviti. Prozor će biti podijeljen u dva "
"područja: veze upita na vrhu i kolone upita ispod."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:499
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the table <replaceable>Persons</replaceable> in the drop down list "
"<guilabel>Table:</guilabel> located at the top of the window and click the "
"<guilabel>Insert</guilabel> button. A graphical representation of the table "
"will appear in the relations area. Do the same for the <replaceable>Phones</"
"replaceable> table to insert it too."
msgstr ""
"Selektirajte  tablicu <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> u padajućoj listi "
"<guilabel>Tablice:</guilabel> lociranoj na vrhu prozora i kliknite dugme "
"<guilabel>Umetni</guilabel>. Grafička reprezentacija tablice će se pojaviti "
"u području veza. Kako biste dodali i tablicu  <replaceable>Telefoni</"
"replaceable>, provedite opisani postupak ponovno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:500
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Add query relationship using mouse drag &amp; drop technique: click the "
"field <replaceable>id</replaceable> in the <replaceable>persons</"
"replaceable> table, drag it and drop into the <replaceable>person</"
"replaceable> field of the <replaceable>Phones</replaceable> table. This will "
"join both fields by creating a new relationship."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte vezu upita koristeći prevuci &amp; pusti tehniku: kliknite na polje "
"<replaceable>id</replaceable> u tablici <replaceable>osobe</replaceable> . "
"Prevucite i pustite polje <replaceable>osoba</replaceable> u tablici "
"<replaceable>Telefoni</replaceable>. Ovo će spojiti oba polja i napraviti "
"novu vezu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:501
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Double-click the <replaceable>name</replaceable> field in the "
"<replaceable>Persons</replaceable> table, to add the field as a query "
"column. In a similar way, add <replaceable>surname</replaceable>, "
"<replaceable>street</replaceable>, <replaceable>house_number</replaceable>, "
"<replaceable>city</replaceable> fields from the <replaceable>Persons</"
"replaceable> table and <replaceable>phone</replaceable> from the "
"<replaceable>Phones</replaceable> table."
msgstr ""
"Duplim klikom na polje  <replaceable>ime</replaceable> u tablici "
"<replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> dodajte polje kao kolonu upita. Na sličan "
"način, dodajte i polja <replaceable>prezime</replaceable>, "
"<replaceable>ulica</replaceable>, <replaceable>broj_fiksnog</replaceable>, "
"<replaceable>grad</replaceable> iz tablice <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> "
"i <replaceable>telefon</replaceable> iz tablice <replaceable>Telefoni</"
"replaceable>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:502
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Query design is now ready for testing. Click the <guilabel>Data</guilabel> "
"button on the toolbar, to switch from design to viewing the data provided as "
"query results."
msgstr ""
"Dizajn upita je sada spreman za testiranje. Kliknite na dugme "
"<guilabel>Podaci</guilabel> na alatnoj traci da biste se prebacili iz načina "
"dizajniranja u način pregleda podataka koji su dobijeni kao rezultati upita."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:503
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Save the query design for later use by clicking the <guilabel>Save</"
"guilabel> button on the toolbar. Because the query design has not been saved "
"yet, you will be asked to specify a name for it. Enter "
"<replaceable>Contacts</replaceable> text in the caption field and click the "
"<guilabel>OK</guilabel> button."
msgstr ""
"Snimite dizajn upita za naknadnu upotrebu klikom na dugme <guilabel>Snimi</"
"guilabel> u alatnoj traci. Dizajn upita još uvijek nije snimljen, te iz tog "
"razloga ćete biti upitani da unesete njegovo ime. Unesite "
"<replaceable>Kontakti</replaceable> text u polje naslova i kliknite na dugme "
"<guilabel>OK</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:506
#, no-c-format
msgid "Designing Forms"
msgstr "Dizajniranje formi"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid "Most important terms"
msgstr "Najvažniji pojmovi"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:524
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Form</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Forma</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:526
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A window provided for easy data entry and presentation on the computer "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"Prozor namijenjen za jednostavan unos podataka i prikaz na ekranu računara."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:529
#, no-c-format
msgid "Form's data source"
msgstr "Izvor podataka obrasca"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:531
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Database table or query providing data displayed in the form. The data "
"source is needed because forms itself are only tools for displaying and "
"entering data, while tables and queries are the source of data. New, empty "
"forms have no data source assigned, so they are not displaying any data from "
"your database unless you assign a data source to them."
msgstr ""
"Tablice ili upiti baza podataka pružaju podatke koji su prikazani u obrascu. "
"Izvor podataka je potreban jer obrasci su  jedini alati za prikaz i unos "
"podataka, dok su tablice i upiti  izvori podataka. Novi, prazni obrazac nema "
"dodijeljen izvor podataka, tako da obrasci ne prikazuju nikakve podatke iz "
"vaše baze podataka ukoliko im ne dodijelite izvor podataka."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:534
#, no-c-format
msgid "Form field"
msgstr "Polje obrasca"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Direct equivalent of a column in a table or query. Most frequently used are "
"fields for displaying text and numbers. Entering a new value or changing the "
"existing value of such a field causes a change in the bound table or query "
"column (after accepting the change)."
msgstr ""
"Ekvivalent kolone u tablici ili upitu. Najčešće korištena polja su polja za "
"prikaz teksta i brojeva. Unosom nove vrijednosti ili promjenom postojeće "
"vrijednosti se uzrokuje promjena razmatrane kolone u tablici ili upitu "
"(nakon prihvatanja promjene)."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:539
#, no-c-format
msgid "Form design"
msgstr "Dizajn obrasca"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:541
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tasks you are performing to define the appearance and functions of the form. "
"To do this, you need to provide data source, insert form fields of various "
"types and place them at the appropriate location."
msgstr ""
"Zadatak koji obavljate da bi definisali izgled i funkcionalnost obraca. Da "
"biste ovo uradili, morate dodijeliti izvor podataka, umetnuti polja obrasca "
"različitog tipa i smjestiti ih u odgovarajuću lokaciju."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid "Form widget"
msgstr "Alati obrasca"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:546
#, no-c-format
msgid "Form's element. Main widget types are:"
msgstr "Elementi obrasca. Glavni tipovi ovih alata su:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:548
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Widgets displaying information, &eg; a text box or an image box. Each widget "
"of this type can be bound to a data source field (a table or a query "
"column). Therefore, such widgets are called in short form fields."
msgstr ""
"Alati za prikaz informacija, &eg; tekstualni ili slikovni okvir. Svaki alat "
"ovog tipa može se dodijeliti izvoru podataka(koloni upita ili tablice). "
"Stoga, ovakvi alati se nazivaju i polja obrasca."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:549
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Widgets able to perform a specified action, &eg; a push button that can "
"close the current form. Within other applications this widget type is "
"sometimes called form control because it can perform previously defined "
"action of controlling your database application's behavior."
msgstr ""
"Alati koji su u mogućnosti da obave neku specifičnu akciju, &eg; pritisnuti "
"dugme koje zatvara trenutni obrazac. U ostalim aplikacijama, alati ovog tipa "
"se nekada nazivaju kontrole jer su u mogućnosti definirati akcije kontrole "
"ponašanja vaše baze podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Other widgets allowing to enrich a form's appearance, &eg; a “line widget” "
"can visually separate two form areas."
msgstr ""
"Ostali alati služe za obogaćivanje izgleda obrasca, &eg; \"linijski alat\" "
"može razdvojiti dva dijela obrasca."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:555
#, no-c-format
msgid "Container widget"
msgstr "Kontejnerski alat"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:557
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A widget that can contain other widgets within its area. For example, frame "
"widget or tab widget are containers. The form's surface itself is a "
"container as well. A command button cannot be called as container because it "
"is not possible to insert a widget inside it. In more complex cases, "
"container widgets can be inserted inside a container, so nesting is possible."
msgstr ""
"Alat koji može sadržavati ostale alate unutar sebe. Npr. alati poput okvira "
"ili kartice su kontejneri. Površina obrasca je sama po sebi također "
"kontejner. Dugme se ne može svrstati u kontejnerske alate jer nije moguće "
"dodati neki drugi alat unutar njega samog. U malo komplikovanijim "
"slučajevima, kontejnerski alati se mogu dodati unutar drugog kontejnerskog "
"alata što znači da je podržano ugnježđivanje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:562
#, no-c-format
msgid "Forms versus tables"
msgstr "Obrasci u komparaciji sa tablicama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:563
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In chapter <link linkend=\"entering-data-into-tables\">Entering Data Into "
"Tables</link> you learned about how to enter data directly into tables using "
"their data sheet view. However, in many cases forms are better suited for "
"data entry:"
msgstr ""
"U poglavlju <link linkend=\"entering-data-into-tables\">Unos podataka u "
"tablice</link> ste naučili kako unijeti podatke direktno u tablicu koristeći "
"stranični pregled. Međutim, u mnogim slučajevima obrasci se pokazuju boljim "
"izborom za unos podataka:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A table can contain too many columns to display them on your screen. A form "
"can display such a data using multiple rows."
msgstr ""
"Tablica može da sadrži previše kolona za prikaz na ekran. Obrazac u tom "
"slučaju može podatke prikazati na ekranu u više redova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:567
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A form allows to visually split data fields into logical groups, thus "
"increasing readability. Labels with additional information can be inserted "
"to give users more hints on how to use the form or what given data fields "
"mean."
msgstr ""
"Obrazac vam dozvoljava da vizualno odvojite podatkovna polja u logičke "
"cjeline, te samim time doprinosi čitljivosti. Labele sa dodatnim "
"informacijama se mogu umetnuti da bi se korisnicima dalo više savjeta o tome "
"kako koristiti obrazac i za šta pojedina podatkovna polja služe."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:568
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Command buttons can be used within forms for commonly used commands so users "
"can use forms in a similar way as a standalone applications they know."
msgstr ""
"Komandna dugmad se unutar obrasca mogu koristiti za akcije koje su korisnici "
"navikli raditi s njima i u svakodnevnim aplikacijama s kojima se susreću."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:570
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In data sheet view displaying multi-row data text fields or images is as "
"easy as within forms."
msgstr ""
"U straničnom pregledu, prikazivanje podataka u višeredovnim tekstualnim ili "
"slikovnim okvirima je lahko koliko i u obrascima."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:573
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with form design"
msgstr "Rad sa dizajnom obrasca"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:574
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with table or query design, you are able to use Data View and Design "
"View. Form designing is performed in Design View. We will often refer to the "
"form design window as to <emphasis>Form Designer</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Kao i sa dizajnom tablice ili upita, u mogućnosti ste da koristite "
"podatkovni prikaz i prikaz dizajna. Dizajniranje obrasca se obavlja u "
"prikazu dizajna. Često ćemo prozor prikaza dizajna nazivati  "
"<emphasis>Dizajner obrasca</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:577
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new empty form, select <guilabel>Form</guilabel> from the "
"toolbar. Optionally, you can use the <guilabel>Create Object: Form</"
"guilabel> command from drop-down button on the Project Navigator's toolbar "
"or <guilabel>Create Object: Form</guilabel> command from the context menu of "
"the Project Navigator."
msgstr ""
"Da kreirate novi, prazni obrazac, odaberite <guilabel>Obrazac</guilabel> iz "
"trake alata. Opcionalno, možete koristiti i komandu <guilabel>Kreiraj "
"objekat: Obrazac</guilabel> iz padajućeg dugmeta lociranog na alatnoj traci "
"navigatora projekta ili komandu <guilabel>Kreiraj objekat: Obrazac</"
"guilabel> iz kontestnog menija u navigatoru projekta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:578
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A new frame will appear, you can resize the form by moving the borders. The "
"form is covered with a grid which simplifies accurate positioning of the "
"widgets."
msgstr ""
"Novi obrazac će se pojaviti, možete mu mijenjati dimenzije tako što ćete "
"pomjerati granice. Obrazac je prekiven rešetkom što olakšava precizno "
"pozicioniranje alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:580
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with table design, Form Designer provides a <guilabel>Property Editor</"
"guilabel> pane. To save some space on the screen, the pane has three tabs "
"related to the currently selected form:"
msgstr ""
"Kao i u dizajnu tablice, dizajner obrasca sadrži okvir <guilabel>Uređivač "
"osobina</guilabel>. Da biste uštedjeli malo mjesta na ekranu, okvir "
"posjeduje tri kartice koje se odnose na trenutno odabrani obrazac."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:583
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Properties tab"
msgstr "Kartica osobina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:585
#, no-c-format
msgid "Contains a list of properties for the currently selected widget."
msgstr "Sadrži listu osobina trenutno odabranog alata."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Data source tab"
msgstr "Kartica izvora podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:590
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Contains properties related specifically to the data source of the currently "
"selected widget or the form itself."
msgstr ""
"Sadrži osobine vezane uz izvor podataka trenutno selektiranog alata ili "
"samog obrasca."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:593
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Widgets tab"
msgstr "Kartica alata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:595
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Contains a hierarchy of all widgets of the form. The list simplifies widgets "
"lookup by name and navigation between them."
msgstr ""
"Sadrži hijerarhiju svih alata na obrascu. Lista pojednostavljuje pretragu "
"alata po imenu i kretanje među njima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:599
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is information about currently selected widget's name and type "
"displayed on the first and second tab."
msgstr ""
"Postoji informacija o nazivu i tipu trenutno odabranog alata prikazana na "
"prvoj ili drugoj kartici."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:601
#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional toolbars are also available:"
msgstr "Dodatne alatne trake su također dostupne:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:604
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Widgets</guilabel> toolbar used for inserting new widgets into "
"the form. Select <guibutton>Form Design</guibutton> to display it."
msgstr ""
"Alatna traka <guilabel>Alati</guilabel> se koristi za umetanje novih alata "
"na obrazac. Za prikaz ove alatne trake odaberite <guibutton>Dizajn obrasca</"
"guibutton> ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:609
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Widgets tab"
msgstr "Korištenje kartice alata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:610
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The widgets tab <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-"
"action-widgets.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> in "
"the <guilabel>Properties</guilabel> pane provides a list of form widgets and "
"their hierarchy. Each widget is presented within the hierarchy beside other "
"widgets being on the same level (the same parent container). Child widgets "
"(inside containers) are presented using indented names."
msgstr ""
"Kartica alata <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-"
"action-widgets.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> u "
"okviru <guilabel>Osobine</guilabel> sadrži listu alata na obrascu i njihovu "
"hijerarhiju. Svaki alat je unutar hijerarhije prikazan je pored ostalih "
"alata istog nivoa (koji imaju isti roditeljski kontejner). Djeca alati(alati "
"unutar kontejnera) su prikazani koristeći uvučeni prikaz imena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:612
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each widget has displayed its name and type. The type has also an icon "
"displayed - the same as the one displayed on the toolbar used while form "
"designing is performed."
msgstr ""
"Svaki alat prikazuje svoje ime i tip. Tip ima prikazanu i ikonu - istu ikonu "
"kao i onu prikazanu na alatnoj traci dok obavlja dizajn obrasca."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:616
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changing the current selection on the list causes appropriate selection on "
"the designed form. This allows for easier widget lookup by name and easier "
"navigation. For example, it is possible to select a widget by name, and then "
"switch to the <guilabel>Properties</guilabel> tab to change the widget's "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Promjenom trenutog odabira na listi se mijenja i odabir u dizajneru obrasca. "
"Ovo omogućava lakšu navigaciju i pretragu alata po imenu. Na primjer, moguće "
"je selektovati naziv alata, a potom se prebaciti na karticu "
"<guilabel>Osobine</guilabel> u svrhu promjene osobina alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keeping the &Ctrl; key pressed while an item on the widgets list is being "
"selected allows to select multiple widgets at a time. Keeping the &Shift; "
"key pressed allows to select entire lists of widgets."
msgstr ""
"Držeći &Ctr; tipku pritisnutom, prilikom odabira alata na listi, moguće je "
"napraviti višestruki odabir alata u isto vrijeme. Držeći tipku &Shift; "
"pritisnutom, omogućava se selektovanje kompletne liste alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:620
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Giving widgets reasonable names can be useful but is not mandatory. Note "
"that widget's name is a property that is not visible to the user of your "
"form. Users will only see a widget text, provided by <guilabel>Text</"
"guilabel> property or similar."
msgstr ""
"Davanje smislenih imena alatima može biti korisno ali nije neophodno. Imajte "
"na umu da naziv alata je osobina koja nije vidljiva korisniku vašeg obrasca. "
"Korisnik će vidjeti samo tekst tog alata (kontrole), koji možete postaviti "
"koristeći osobinu <guilabel>Text</guilabel> i sl."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:623
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inserting widgets - text fields"
msgstr "Umetanje alata tekstualnih okvira"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:624
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let's create a form providing information about persons, &ie; a form "
"connected it with <replaceable>Persons</replaceable> table."
msgstr ""
"Kreirajmo sada obrazac koji daje informaciju o osobama, &ie; obrazac povezan "
"sa tablicom <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:626
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the form being designed should present data obtained from the database, "
"you need to place appropriate fields on it. To do this, use the buttons on "
"the <guilabel>Widgets</guilabel> toolbar. Each button corresponds to a "
"single widget type."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko želite obrazac dizajnirati tako da prikazuje podatke dobijene iz "
"baze podataka, morate postaviti odgovarajuća polja na njega. Da biste "
"uradili ovo, koristite dugmad na alatnoj traci <guilabel>Alati</guilabel>. "
"Svako dugme korespondira odgovarajućem tipu alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:629
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click <guilabel>Text Box</guilabel> button on the <guilabel>Widgets</"
"guilabel> toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite <guilabel>Tekstualni okvir</guilabel> dugme na alatnoj traci "
"<guilabel>Alati</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:630
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the form surface with the left mouse button. A new text box widget "
"will be placed in the point where you clicked. Before you release you can "
"drag your mouse to specify a desired size for the widget."
msgstr ""
"Klinite lijevim klikom miša na površinu obrasca. Novi tekstualni okvir će se "
"postaviti na obrazac tamo gdje ste kliknuli. Prije nego pustite klik miša, "
"možete vući miš da specificirate željenu veličinu alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:631
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If needed, move the inserted widget using drag &amp; drop to a desired "
"position. You can resize the widget afterwards by dragging one of the small "
"boxes appearing near its corners. Note that the boxes are only visible when "
"the widget is selected. If you select another widget or the form surface, "
"the boxes disappear."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko je potrebno, možete pomjeriti umetnutni alat na željenu poziciju "
"koristeći prevuci &amp; pusti. Možete promijeniti veličinu alata naknadno, "
"tako što ćete vući jedan od malih okvira prikazanih blizu krajeva prozora. "
"Imajte na umu da su ti okviri vidljivi samo kada je alat selektiran. Ukoliko "
"selektirate drugi alat sa površine obrasca, okviri će nestati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guilabel>Text Box</guilabel> toolbar button again and click on "
"the form surface to insert another widget. Repeat this action once again "
"until you get three more text boxes inserted in your form. For the sake of "
"simplicity we will limit ourselves to five data fields."
msgstr ""
"Ponovo kliknite dugme <guilabel>Tekstualni okvir </guilabel> sa alatne trake "
"i kliknite na površinu obrasca da umetnete još jedan alat. Ponavljate ovaj "
"postupak dok ne budete imali još tri tekstualna okvira na vašem obrascu. "
"Zbog jednostavnosti, ograničit ćemo se na pet podatkovnih polja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:636
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is a context menu available in form's design mode, activated by a "
"right mouse button click the desired widget or the form's surface. The menu "
"offers commands like <guilabel>Cut</guilabel>, <guilabel>Copy</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Paste</guilabel>, <guilabel>Delete</guilabel> and other, more "
"complex. Keyboard shortcuts are also available for these commands. Some of "
"the commands are only available for certain types of widgets."
msgstr ""
"Kontekstni meni koji je dostupan unutar dizajnerskog moda obrasca, se "
"aktivira desnim klikom na željeni alat ili površinu obrasca. Ovaj meni nudi "
"komande poput <guilabel>Isijeci</guilabel>, <guilabel>Kopiraj</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Umetni</guilabel>, <guilabel>Obriši</guilabel> i druge, malo "
"kompeksnije. Kratice na tastaturi su također dostupne za ove komande. Neke "
"komadne su dostupne samo za neke određene tipove alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:637
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The commands <guilabel>Cut</guilabel>, <guilabel>Copy</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Paste</guilabel> makes it possible to move or copy widgets between "
"forms, even between separate database projects."
msgstr ""
"Komande <guilabel>Isijeci</guilabel>, <guilabel>Kopiraj</guilabel> i "
"<guilabel>Umetni</guilabel> omogućavaju prenos ili kopiranje alata između "
"obrazaca, čak i u odvojene projekte baza podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:638
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Holding the &Ctrl; key down while clicking a widget allows to select "
"multiple widgets."
msgstr ""
"Držeći &Ctr; tipku pritisnutom prilikom klikanja na alat, omogućava se "
"selektiranje više alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:639
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instead of using <guilabel>Copy</guilabel> and <guilabel>Paste</guilabel> "
"commands, to duplicate a widget within the same form you can hold down the "
"&Ctrl; key while moving the widget. After the mouse button is released, the "
"dragged widget will not be moved but copied in the new location."
msgstr ""
"Umjesto korištenja komadni <guilabel>Kopiraj</guilabel> i <guilabel>Umetni</"
"guilabel> za kopiranje alata unutar istog obrasca, možete držati tipku "
"&Ctrl; pritisnutom prilikom pomjeranja alata. Nakon što pustite tipku miša, "
"odabrani alat neće biti premješten već koopiran na novu lokaciju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:643
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigning data sources"
msgstr "Dodjeljivanje izvora podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:644
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The fields you inserted have no data source assigned yet, so these are not "
"able to display information from the database. To assign data source, use "
"the <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-server-"
"database.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> (Data "
"Source) tab of the <guilabel>Property Editor</guilabel> pane."
msgstr ""
"Polja koja ste umetnuli još uvijek nemaju dodijeljen izvor podataka, tako da "
"nisu u mogućnosti prikazivati informacije iz baze podataka. Da izvršite "
"dodjelu izvora podataka, koristite <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"Icon-server-database.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </"
"imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> (Izvor podataka) karticu u okviru "
"<guilabel>Uređivač osobina</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:646
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The very first step is to specify the form's data source, &ie; a place the "
"displayed data will be fetched from. As mentioned above, you will use table "
"<replaceable>Persons</replaceable> as a data source for your new form."
msgstr ""
"Prvi korak jeste specificiranje izvora podataka, &ie; mjesto s kojeg će se "
"pokupiti podaci koje želite prikazati. Kao što je gore navedeno, koristit "
"ćete tablicu <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> kao izvor podataka za vaš novi "
"obrazac."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:649
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on the form's surface, as you will alter its properties."
msgstr "Kliknite na površinu obrasca, u svrhu promjene njegovih osobina."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:650
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Switch to the <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-"
"server-database.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> "
"(Data Source) tab and enter <replaceable>persons</replaceable> table name in "
"the <guilabel>Form's data source</guilabel> drop down list. Alternatively, "
"you can select this name from the drop down list."
msgstr ""
"Prebacite se na karticu <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"Icon-server-database.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> (Izvor podataka) i unesite naziv tablice "
"<replaceable>osobe</replaceable> u <guilabel>Izvor podataka obrasca</"
"guilabel> padajuću listu. Alternativno, možete selektovati ovo ime iz "
"padajuće liste."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:652
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have assigned form's data source. Now you need to do specify widget's "
"data source."
msgstr ""
"Dodijelili ste izvor podataka obrasca. Sada trebate specificirati izvor "
"podatka alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:655
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click the first text field widget at the top of the form."
msgstr "Kliknite prvi tekstualni okvir na vrhu obrasca."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:656
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-server-"
"database.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> (Data "
"Source) tab of the property pane enter field name <replaceable>name</"
"replaceable> in the <guilabel>Widget's data source</guilabel> drop down "
"list. Alternatively, you can select this name from the drop down list."
msgstr ""
"U kartici <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-server-"
"database.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> (Izvor "
"podataka) okvira osobina, unesite ime polja <replaceable>ime</replaceable> u "
"<guilabel>Izvor podataka alata</guilabel> padajuću listu. Alternativno, "
"možete selektovati ime iz padajuće liste."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:657
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on next text field widget and enter <replaceable>surname</replaceable> "
"as the data source."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na sljedeće polja i unesite <replaceable>prezime</replaceable> kao "
"izvor podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:658
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter data sources for street, house_number and city text fields in a "
"similar way."
msgstr ""
"Na sličan način, unesite izvore podataka za tekstualne okvire ulice, broja "
"fiksnog telefona i grada."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:660
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can now save the form's design (this is not mandatory to test the form "
"in action). To save, click the <guilabel>Save</guilabel> toolbar button. "
"Upon saving you will be asked for entering the form's name. Enter "
"<replaceable>Persons</replaceable> as caption and click the <guilabel>OK</"
"guilabel> button. The form's name will be filled automatically."
msgstr ""
"Sada možete snimiti dizajn obrasca (ovo nije neophodno za testiranje "
"obrasca). Da snimite, kliknite  <guilabel>Snimi</guilabel> dugme alatne "
"trake. Po snimanju, tražit će se da unesete naziv obrasca. Unesite "
"<replaceable>Osobe</replaceable> kao naslov i kliknite dugme <guilabel>OK</"
"guilabel>. Ime obrasca će se automatski popuniti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:662
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the right moment for testing your form. Click the <guilabel>Data</"
"guilabel> toolbar button. Unless you made a mistake while entering data "
"sources, you should see the form's fields filled with data from the "
"<replaceable>Persons</replaceable> table."
msgstr ""
"Sada je vrijeme za testiranje vašeg obrasca. Kliknite na dugme "
"<guilabel>Podaci</guilabel> na alatnoj traci. Ukoliko niste napravili grešku "
"tokom unosa izvora podataka, trebali biste vidjeti obrazac popunjen sa "
"podacima iz tablice <replaceable>Osobe</replaceable>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:666
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to remove widget's data source assignment for a form widget, you "
"can use the <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-edit-"
"clear-locationbar-rtl.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> button in the <guilabel>Widget's data source</guilabel> "
"box."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko želite ukloniti dodijeljeni izvor podataka nekog alata u obrascu, "
"možete koristiti dugme  <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"Icon-edit-clear-locationbar-rtl.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> u okviru <guilabel>Izvor podataka alata</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-go-jump."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> (Go to selected "
"form's data source) button to select appropriate table or query in the "
"<guilabel>Project Navigator</guilabel>, so you can quickly open a table or "
"query being the data source of the form."
msgstr ""
"Koristite dugme <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"Icon-"
"go-jump.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> (Idi na "
"selektovani izvor podataka) za selektiranje odgovarajuće tablice ili upita u "
"<guilabel>Project Navigator</guilabel>, kako biste brzo otvorili tablicu ili "
"upit koju želite koristiti za izvor podataka obrasca."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:671
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inserting text labels"
msgstr "Umetanje teksutalnih labela(oznaka)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:672
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To make it easier for the form's user to identify the meaning of every field "
"widget, these should have added text labels with appropriate titles. To "
"create text labels the <guilabel>Label</guilabel> widget is used."
msgstr ""
"Da bi korisniku obrasca olakšali razumijevanje svakog pojedinačnog alata, "
"isti bi trebali  imati prikladne tekstualne oznake u skladu s njihovim "
"nazivima. Za kreiranje tekstualne oznake, koristi se alat <guilabel>Oznaka</"
"guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:674
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Insert three text label widgets onto the form, placing them on the left side "
"of the text fields (or on the right hand if your operating system uses right-"
"to-left layout). On inserting a new label, a text cursor appears at the "
"location where you can enter the desired title. Enter consecutively: "
"<replaceable>Name</replaceable>, <replaceable>Surname</replaceable>, "
"<replaceable>Street</replaceable>, <replaceable>House Number</replaceable> "
"and <replaceable>City</replaceable>. Additionally, on the top of the form "
"insert another label displaying name of the form, &ie; <replaceable>Persons</"
"replaceable>. Enlarge this label's size and increase the font size using "
"<guilabel>Font</guilabel> in the <guilabel>Properties</guilabel> tab."
msgstr ""
"Umetnite tri tekstualne oznake na obrazac i smjestite ih s lijeve strane "
"svakog tekstualnog okvira (ili s desne ruke ukoliko vaš operativni sistem "
"koristi prikaz desno-lijevo). Po umetanju oznake, kursor teksta se "
"pojavljuje na lokaciji gdje možete unijete željeni naslov. Unesite jedno za "
"drugim: <replaceable>Ime</replaceable>, <replaceable>Prezime</replaceable>, "
"<replaceable>Ulica</replaceable>, <replaceable>Broj kuće</replaceable> i "
"<replaceable>Grad</replaceable>. Dodatno, možete na vrhu obrasca postaviti "
"još jednu tekstualnu oznaku koja će prikazivati naziv obrasca, &ie; "
"<replaceable>Osobe</replaceable>. Uvećajte veličinu oznake i povećajte "
"veličinu slova koristeći <guilabel>Font</guilabel> u kartici "
"<guilabel>Osobine</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:677
#, no-c-format
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Akcije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:678
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An Action is a single activity isolated in the application, available for "
"the user to execute. It can also be executed automatically as a reaction for "
"a given event (&eg; after opening a form)."
msgstr "Akcija (radnja) je aktivnost vezana za aplikaciju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:680
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigning actions to form buttons"
msgstr "Dodjeljivanje akcija dugmadima na obrascu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:681
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many actions can be assigned to form button. The assigned action is executed "
"after button is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Mnoge akcije se mogu dodijeliti dugmetu. Dodijeljena akcija s izvršava nakon "
"što je kliknuto dugme miša."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:683
#, no-c-format
msgid "To assign action:"
msgstr "Da bi dodijelili akciju:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:686
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switch to form's Design view if you have not done yet."
msgstr "Ukoliko već niste, prebacite se na dizajn obrasca."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:687
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the existing button widget by clicking on it or put a new button "
"widget onto the form. If you inserted a new button, enter its title and "
"press &Enter; key."
msgstr ""
"Selektiraje postojeće dugme tako što ćete kliknuti na isto ili dodajte novo "
"dugme na obrazac. Ukoliko ste dodali novo dugme, unesite njegov naziv i "
"pritisnite tipku &Enter;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:688
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the button widget with the right mouse button to display the context "
"menu."
msgstr "Kliknite dugme desnim klikom u svrhu prikaza kontekstnog menija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:689
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the context menu select <guilabel>Assign action...</guilabel> command."
msgstr ""
"Iz kontekstnog menija odaberite komadnu <guilabel>Dodijeli akciju...</"
"guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:690
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An <guilabel>Assigning Action to Button</guilabel> dialog window will appear "
"presenting a list of available actions. One of the actions is selected if "
"the widget already has action assigned. Otherwise the <guilabel>Action "
"category</guilabel> list has the <guilabel>No action</guilabel> item "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Pojaviće se prozor <guilabel>Dodjeljivanje akcije dugmetu</guilabel> u kome "
"su prikazane dostupne akcije. Jedna od akcija je selektovana ukoliko alat "
"već ima neku akciju dodijeljenu. U suprotnom, lista <guilabel>Kategorija "
"akcija</guilabel> ima selektovanu stavku <guilabel>Nema opcije</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:691
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the <guilabel>Action category</guilabel> list select "
"<guilabel>Application actions</guilabel> item. Available application-wide "
"actions will be listed."
msgstr ""
"Iz liste  <guilabel>Kategorije akcije</guilabel> odaberite stavku "
"<guilabel>Akcije aplikacije</guilabel>. Dostupne akcije će biti prikazane."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:692
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select one of the actions on the list (&eg; <guilabel>Delete Selected "
"object</guilabel>)."
msgstr ""
"Selektirajte jednu od akcija na listi (&eg; <guilabel>Obrišite selektovane "
"objekte</guilabel>)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:695
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After switching to the form's data view you can try whether the action works."
msgstr ""
"Nakon prelaska na podatkovni prikaz obrasca, možete isprobati da li "
"dodijeljena akcija uspješno radi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:699
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove an action assignment, select the <guilabel>No action</guilabel> "
"item from the <guilabel>Action category</guilabel> list of the "
"<guilabel>Assigning Action to Button</guilabel> dialog window."
msgstr ""
"Da uklonite dodijeljenju akciju, selektirajte stavku <guilabel>Nema akcije</"
"guilabel> iz liste <guilabel>Kategorije akcija</guilabel> u prozoru "
"<guilabel>Dodjeljivanje akcija dugmetu</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:700
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Actions only work in the form's data view. Not every action's assignment is "
"reasonable. For example, the <guilabel>Font...</guilabel> action is "
"available in data view, but only if you have a widget selected in the Design "
"view. If you make changes to the font settings the changes are applied to "
"the text of that selected widget."
msgstr ""
"Akcije rade samo u podatkovnom prikazu obrasca. Nije svaka dodjela akcije "
"smislena. Na primjer, akcija <guilabel>Font...</guilabel> je dostupna u "
"podatkovnom prikazu, ali samo ukoliko ste selektirali razmatrani alat u "
"dizajnerskom prikazu. Ukoliko izvršite promjenu postavke slova, promjene će "
"se odraziti na text dotičnog alata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:705
#, no-c-format
msgid "Widget layouts"
msgstr "Raspored alata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:706
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In most cases form widgets should be conveniently arranged and aligned. "
"Positioning, aligning and resizing widgets by hand is not easy and these "
"parameters are not adjusted when the user resizes the form. In fact the "
"situation is even worse because you cannot assume a given form requires a "
"given space because users have different font sizes and display resolutions."
msgstr ""
"U većini slučaja, alati kao što su obrasci su po konvenciji uređeni i "
"usklađeni. Ručno pozicioniranje, postrojavanje i promjena veličine nije "
"jednostavna i ovi parametri se ne mijenjaju kada korisnik promijeni veličinu "
"obrasca. U stvari, situacija je čak i gora, jer ne možete unaprijed "
"pretpostaviti potrebni prostor obrasca, jer korisnici imaju različite "
"rezolucije ekrana i veličinu slova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:708
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using special tool called widget layouts can help to automatically lay out "
"the form widgets. Widget layout is an action of grouping two or more widgets "
"so these are well positioned and have appropriate sizes."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći specijalni alat nazvan kao raspored alata može vam biti od pomoći "
"za automatsko raspoređivanje obrazaca. Rapored alata je akcija grupisanja "
"dva ili više alata u svrhu dobrog pozicioniranja i prikladne veličine istih."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:710
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using layout in a form improves alignment. Moreover, its space is better "
"used. Text fields are closer to each other, spacing is constant."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći raspored unutar obrasca, poboljšava se poravnanje. Čak štaviše, "
"prostor je bolje iskorišten. Tekstualni okviri su bliže jedan drugom i "
"odstojanje je konstantno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:760
#, no-c-format
msgid "Size policies for widgets within a layout"
msgstr "Politika veličine za alate unutar rasporeda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instead of setting a fixed size for your widgets, in &kexi; you can choose "
"between various widget's size policies. A size policy is a flexible strategy "
"for controlling how a widget is stretched (or shrunk) depending on other "
"neighbouring widgets and space available within the form."
msgstr ""
"Umjesto postavljanja fiksirane veličine vaših alata, u &kexi; možete "
"odabrati između raznih politika veličine. Politika veličine je fleksibilna "
"strategija za kontrolisanje načina razvlačenja(ili skupljanja) u ovisnosti "
"od komšijskih alata i dostupnog prostora unutar obrasca."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:763
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After putting widgets into on a line will be resized to fit their visible "
"text."
msgstr ""
"Nakon postavljanja alata, linija će promijeniti dimenzije u svrhu najbolje "
"vidljivosti njihovog teksta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:765
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each widget inserted into the form, there are settings for size policy "
"available in the <guilabel>Property Editor</guilabel>. The settings are "
"presented as a group of properties called <guilabel>Size Policy</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Za svaki alat umetnut u obrazac, postoje opcije za politiku veličine, "
"dostupne u <guilabel>Uređivač opcija</guilabel>. Ove opcije su prikazane kao "
"grupa osobina nazvanih <guilabel>Politika veličine</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:767
#, no-c-format
msgid "This group of properties contains:"
msgstr "Ova grupa osobina sadrži:"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:770
#, no-c-format
msgid "Horizontal Size Policy"
msgstr "Horizontalna politika veličine"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:772
#, no-c-format
msgid "defining horizontal size of the widget,"
msgstr "definira horizontalnu veličinu alata."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:775
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vertical Size Policy"
msgstr "Vertikalna politika veličine"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:777
#, no-c-format
msgid "defining vertical size of the widget,"
msgstr "definira vertikalnu veličinu alata."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:780
#, no-c-format
msgid "Horizontal Stretch"
msgstr "Vodoravno širenje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:782
#, no-c-format
msgid "defining strength of activity of the Horizontal Size Policy,"
msgstr "definira snagu akcije horizontalne politike veličine."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:785
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vertical Stretch"
msgstr "Uspravno širenje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:787
#, no-c-format
msgid "defining strength of activity of the Vertical Size Policy"
msgstr "definira snagu akcije vertikalne politike veličine"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:792
#, no-c-format
msgid "Values of size policies"
msgstr "Vrijednosti politike veličine"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:793
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following values are available in the drop down list for <guilabel>Hor. "
"Policy</guilabel> and <guilabel>Vert. Policy</guilabel> visible in the "
"<guilabel>Property Editor</guilabel>:"
msgstr ""
"Sljedeće vrijednosti su dostupne u padajućoj listi za <guilabel>Hor. "
"politiku</guilabel> i <guilabel>Vert. politiku</guilabel> vidljivu u  "
"<guilabel>Uređivač osobina</guilabel>."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:796
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fixed"
msgstr "Fiksno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"this value means that the widget cannot be automatically resized; it should "
"maintain the constant size defined at design time (width or height),"
msgstr ""
"ovaj vrijednost označava da se alatu ne mogu automatski promijeniti "
"dimenzije; trebala bi se održavati konstantna veličina koja je dizajnirana "
"prilikom dizajniranja alata (širina ili visina),"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:801
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimum"
msgstr "Minimum"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:803
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"this value means that the original size of the widget is set as minimal "
"allowed, it is sufficient and there is no need for expanding the widget, but "
"the widget will be expanded if needed. This type of policy can be used to "
"force the widget to be expanded to the whole width or height, especially if "
"you set a stretch value greater than 0."
msgstr ""
"ova vrijednost označava da je originalna veličina alata postavljena na "
"najnižu moguću, da je to dovoljno i da nema potrebe za raširivanjem alata, "
"ali se po potrebi može raširiti. Ovaj tip politike se može koristiti za "
"prisiljavanje alata proširenog na cijelu širinu i dužinu, posebno ako je "
"vrijednost rastezanja veća od nule."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:806
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "Maksimum"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:808
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"this value means that the original size of the widget is set as maximum "
"allowed and can be decreased without breaking the widget's usability and "
"readability if other widgets need more space,"
msgstr ""
"ova vrijednost znači da je originalna veličina alata postavljena na "
"maksimalnu dozvoljenu i da se može smanjivati bez smanjivanja iskoristivosti "
"i čitljivosti alata, ukoliko neki drugi alat treba više prostora,"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:811
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preferred"
msgstr "Omiljeno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:813
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"this value means that the original size of the widget is the best and "
"preferred; the widget can be shrunk or expanded however and it will stay "
"readable,"
msgstr ""
"ova vrijednost govori da je originalna veličina alata najbolja i omiljena; "
"alat se može skupiti ili rastegnuti bez umanjenja čitljivosti"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:816
#, no-c-format
msgid "Expanding"
msgstr "Šireće"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:818
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"this value means that the original size of the widget is reasonable but the "
"widget can be also shrunk; it can be expanded as well to take as much space "
"as possible,"
msgstr ""
"ova vrijednost označava da je originalna veličina alata razumna, ali da se "
"alat također može skupiti; isto tako se može i razvući da zauzme što više "
"mjesta,"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:821
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimum Expanding"
msgstr "Minimalno šireći"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:823
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"this value means that the original size of the widget is allowed; it can be "
"expanded to take as much space as possible,"
msgstr ""
"ova vrijednost znači da originalna veličina alata je dopuštena; može se "
"proširiti da zauzima koliko god mjesta je moguće,"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:826
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ignored"
msgstr "Ignorisano"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:828
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"this value means that the original size of the widget is ignored; the widget "
"can be expanded to take as much space as possible but other widgets usually "
"will not allow for that"
msgstr ""
"ova vrijednost znači da je originalna veličina alata ignorisana; alat se "
"može proširiti da zauzme koliko god mjesta je moguće ali ostali alati obično "
"to neće dozvoliti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:832
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Different widget types have various default size policies; for example, "
"button widgets have default size policy set to <guilabel>Minimum</guilabel> "
"(in both directions), while text field widgets have vertical size policy set "
"to <guilabel>Fixed</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Različiti tipovi alata imaju drukčije zadane politike veličine; na primjer, "
"dugmad imaju zadanu politiku veličine postavljenu na  <guilabel>Minimum</"
"guilabel> (u oba smjera), dok tekstualna polja imaju vertikalnu politiku "
"veličine postavljenu na <guilabel>Fiksirano</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:834
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The most frequently used size policies are <guilabel>Preferred</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Minimum</guilabel> and <guilabel>Maximum</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Najčešće korištene politike veličine su  <guilabel>Preferirana</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Minimum</guilabel> i <guilabel>Maximum</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:837
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vertical and horizontal stretch"
msgstr "Vertikalno i horizontalno rastezanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:838
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Vert. Stretch</guilabel> and <guilabel>Hor. Stretch</guilabel> "
"properties accept integer values greater than or equal to 0. These "
"properties allow to fine-tune the behavior of size policies. The default "
"value for the properties is 0. A higher value of the stretch means that the "
"widget will be expanded more than widgets for which a lower stretch value is "
"set."
msgstr ""
"Osobine <guilabel>Vert. rastezanje</guilabel> i <guilabel>Hor. rastezanje</"
"guilabel> primaju cjelobrojne vrijednosti veće ili jednake nuli. Ove osobine "
"dopuštaju fino podešavanje ponašanja politike veličine. Zadane vrijednosti "
"za osobine su nula. Što je veća vrijednost rastezanja to znači da će alat "
"biti proširen više u odnosu na alate sa manjom vrijednošču rastezanja."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:939
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering Data Using Forms"
msgstr "Unos podataka koristeći obrasce"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:940
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Data entering and editing is usually the task of the user of the database "
"application. The designer of the database should check the form in terms of "
"valid data entry, and see whether the form works as expected."
msgstr ""
"Unos podataka i uređivanje su najčešće zadaci korisnika aplikacije baze "
"podataka. Dizajner baze podataka bi trebao provjeriti obrasce u smislu "
"validnosti unosa podataka te vidjeti da li obrazac radi kao što je očekivano."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:942
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To test your form, switch to its data view. A single database row (record) "
"of data will be displayed . You can move between fields using the left mouse "
"button or the &Tab; and <keycombo>&Shift;&Tab;</keycombo> keys. While "
"editing, there will be a pencil icon visible near the record navigator. "
"After entering the row's (record) data you can press the <keycombo>&Shift;"
"&Enter;</keycombo> keys or click the <guilabel>Save Record</guilabel> "
"toolbar button to accept changes made to the current row. Clicking the "
"<guilabel>Cancel Record Changes</guilabel> toolbar button discards changes "
"made to the current row and restores the contents of the data fields. You "
"can use the record navigator's button to move to a new row. All the "
"navigator's functions are also available in a similar way as in the data "
"table view."
msgstr ""
"Da biste istestirali vaš obrazac, prebacite se na podatkovni prikaz. Bit će "
"prikazani podaci jednog reda baze podataka(zapis). Možete se kretati kroz "
"polja koristeći lijevi klik miša ili &Tab; i  <keycombo>&Shift;&Tab;</"
"keycombo> tipke. U toku uređivanja, bit će vidljiva ikona olovke blizu  "
"navigatora zapisa. Po unosu podataka iz reda, možete pritisnuti "
"<keycombo>&Shift;&Enter;</keycombo> tipke ili kliknuti na dugme "
"<guilabel>Snimi zapis</guilabel> u alatnoj traci da prihvatite promjene nad "
"trenutnim redom. Klikajući na dugme <guilabel>Poništi promjene zapisa</"
"guilabel> odbaciće te promjene nad trenutnim redom i vratiti prethodni "
"sadržaj tog polja. Možete koristiti dugme navigatora zapisa za prelazak u "
"novi red. Sve funkcije navigatora su također dostupne i na sličan način kao "
"i u podatkovnom prikazu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:946
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring Kexi"
msgstr "Podešavanje Kexi-ja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:948
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"docking-and-undocking-side-panels\">Docking and undocking "
"side panels</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"docking-and-undocking-side-panels\">Zaključavanje i "
"otključavanje bočnih ploča </link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:950
#, no-c-format
msgid "Docking and undocking side panels"
msgstr "Zaključavanje i otključavanje bočnih ploča"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:951
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Project Navigator</guilabel> and <guilabel>Property Editor</"
"guilabel> side panels may be undocked by either:"
msgstr ""
"Bočni paneli(ploče) <guilabel>Navigator projekta</guilabel> i "
"<guilabel>Uređivač osobina</guilabel> mogu biti otključani bilo:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:954
#, no-c-format
msgid "Double-clicking on the 'grip' bar at the top of the panel; or"
msgstr "Duplim klikom na 'zahvat' traku u vrhu ploče; ili"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:955 index.docbook:961
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking once on the diamond button at the top of the panel, next to the x."
msgstr "Jednim klikom na dijamantno dugme u vrhu ploče, pored x."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:957
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once undocked, panel windows may be docked into the main window again "
"similarly to undocking:"
msgstr ""
"Kada se otključa, ploča prozora se ponovo može zaključati u glavnom prozoru "
"na sličan način kao i otključavanje:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:960
#, no-c-format
msgid "Double-clicking on the 'grip' bar at the top of the window; or"
msgstr "Dupli klik na 'zahvat' traku u vrhu prozora; ili"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:963
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When undocking a panel, &kexi; remembers the last docked position so when "
"you dock the panel again it will be placed at the location it was last "
"docked."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom otključavanja ploče, &kexi; pamti posljednju poziciju "
"zaključavanja, tako da kad ponovo zaključavate ploču, bit će postavljena na "
"lokaciju na kojoj je bila zaključana posljednji put."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:967
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr "Upute za naredbe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:969
#, no-c-format
msgid "<link linkend=\"the-kexi-tab\">The Kexi Tab</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr "<link linkend=\"the-kexi-tab\">Kexi kartica</link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:970
#, no-c-format
msgid "<link linkend=\"the-create-tab\">The Create Tab</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr "<link linkend=\"the-create-tab\">Kartica kreiranja</link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:971
#, no-c-format
msgid "<link linkend=\"the-data-tab\">The Data Tab</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr "<link linkend=\"the-data-tab\">Kartica podataka</link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:972
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"the-external-data-tab\">The External Data Tab</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"the-external-data-tab\">Kartica eksternih podataka</"
"link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:973
#, no-c-format
msgid "<link linkend=\"the-tools-tab\">The Tools Tab</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr "<link linkend=\"the-tools-tab\">Alatna kartica</link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:974
#, no-c-format
msgid "<link linkend=\"the-form-design-tab\">The Form Design Tab</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"the-form-design-tab\">Kartica dizajna obrazaca</link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:975
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"the-report-design-tab\">The Report Design Tab</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"the-report-design-tab\">Kartica dizajna izvještaja</"
"link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:977
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Kexi Tab"
msgstr "Kexi kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:991
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kexi; tab is the place where you interact with &kexi;'s projects."
msgstr "&kexi; kartica je mjesto na kom komunicirate s &kexi; projektima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:993
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting an action will open a screen right next to the menu, offering "
"options about the action you chose."
msgstr ""
"Selektiranje nove akcije će otvoriti zaslon desno od menija, nudeći opcije o "
"akciji koju odaberete."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:995
#, no-c-format
msgid "The options offered are:"
msgstr "Ponuđene opcije su:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:998
#, no-c-format
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Dobro došli"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1000
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can select to open a project you recently worked on."
msgstr "Ovdje možete odabrati i otvoriti projekat na kom ste radili nedavno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1003
#, no-c-format
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Otvori"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1005
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can select to open a &kexi; Project whether stored in a file or a "
"database server."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete otvoriti &kexi; projekat bilo pohranjen u datotekama ili "
"serveru baze podataka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1008
#, no-c-format
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Zatvori"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1010
#, no-c-format
msgid "This action closes the &kexi; project you have currently open."
msgstr "Ova akcija zatvara trenutno otvoreni &kexi; projekat."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1013
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>New</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Novi</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1015
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can follow the wizard to create a new &kexi; Project."
msgstr "Ovdje možete pratiti čarobnjaka za kreiranje novog &kexi; projekta."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1018
#, no-c-format
msgid "Import, Export or Send..."
msgstr "Uvezi, Izvezi ili Pošalji..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1020
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can follow the wizard to Import existing data to the currently open "
"&kexi; Project."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete pratiti čarobnjaka za Uvoz postojećih podataka u trenutno "
"otvoreni &kexi; projekat."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1023
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Izađi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1025
#, no-c-format
msgid "Closes &kexi;."
msgstr "Zatvara &kexi;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1030
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Create Tab"
msgstr "Kartica Kreiraj"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1044
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the <guilabel>Create</guilabel> tab you can create objects that will be "
"added to your project."
msgstr ""
"Iz kartice <guilabel>Kreiraj</guilabel> možete kreirati objekte koji će biti "
"dodani u vaš projekat."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1047
#, no-c-format
msgid "Table"
msgstr "Tabela"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1049
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting <guilabel>Table</guilabel> will take you to the table designer at "
"the design view to allow you to add field definitions to your table."
msgstr ""
"Selektovanje <guilabel>Tabela</guilabel> će vas odvesti do dizajnera tabela "
"u dizajnerskom prikazu koji omogućava da dodate definicije polja u vašoj "
"tabeli."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1052
#, no-c-format
msgid "Query"
msgstr "Upit"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1054
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting <guilabel>Query</guilabel> will take you to the query designer at "
"the design view to allow you to design a query to get custom results from "
"your tables in your project."
msgstr ""
"Selektovanje  <guilabel>Upit</guilabel> će vas odvesti u dizajner upita u "
"dizajnerskom prikazu koji vam omogućava dizajniranje upita  za dobijanje "
"različitih rezultata iz vaših tabela u projektu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1057
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Form</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Obrazac</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1059
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting <guilabel>Form</guilabel> will take you to the form designer at "
"the design view to allow you to add widgets to your form."
msgstr ""
"Selektovanje <guilabel>Obrazac</guilabel> će vas odvesti u dizajner obrazaca "
"u dizajnerskom prikazu koji će vam omogućiti dodavanje kontrola(alata) na "
"vaš obrazac."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1062
#, no-c-format
msgid "Report"
msgstr "Izvještaj"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1064
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting <guilabel>Report</guilabel> will take you to the report designer "
"at the design view to allow you to add widgets to your report."
msgstr ""
"Selektovanje <guilabel>Izvještaj</guilabel> će vas odvesti do dizajnera "
"izvještaja u dizajnerskom prikazu koji vam omogućava dodavanje kontrola za "
"vaš izvještaj."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1067
#, no-c-format
msgid "Script"
msgstr "Skripta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1069
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting <guilabel>Script</guilabel> will take you to the script editor to "
"allow you to add custom code for your project and / or objects."
msgstr ""
"Selektovanje  <guilabel>Skripta</guilabel> će vas odvesti do uređivača "
"skripti koji omogućava dodavanje vašeg koda u projekat i/ili objekat."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1074
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Data Tab"
msgstr "Kartica podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1088
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the <guilabel>Data</guilabel> Tab you can manipulate data in your "
"tables or widgets in your objects (forms, reports, etc)"
msgstr ""
"Iz kartice  <guilabel>Podaci</guilabel>  možete kontrolisati podatke u vašim "
"tabelama ili kontrolama u objektima(obrasci, izvještaji itd.)"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1091
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Cut</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Izreži</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1093
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Cut</guilabel>, places the data/widget on the clipboard and "
"removes it from it's current position."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Izreži</guilabel>, postavlja podatak/kontrolu na spremnik i "
"uklanja je sa trenutne pozicije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1096
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopiraj"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1098
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Copy</guilabel>, places the data/widget on the clipboard without "
"removing it from it's current position."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kopiraj</guilabel> smješta podatak/kontrolu na spremnik bez "
"uklanjanja iste sa trenutne pozicije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paste"
msgstr "Zalijepi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Paste</guilabel>, places the data/widget found on the clipboard to "
"the table/object accordingly."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Umetni</guilabel> smješta podatak/kontrolu pronađenu u spremniku u "
"odabranu tabelu/objekat."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paste Special"
msgstr "Posebno umetanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Paste Special</guilabel>, is used to place arbitrary data found on "
"the clipboard to a table, in a way that is predictable so as to be correctly "
"added according to the table's definition."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Posebno umetanje</guilabel> se koristi za smještanje proizvoljnih "
"podataka pronađenih u spremniku u tabelu, na predvidljiv način koji je "
"korektan prema definiciji tabele."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find"
msgstr "Pronađi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Find</guilabel>, opens the <guilabel>Find</guilabel> dialog so as "
"to search for specific text in the database data."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Pronađi</guilabel>, otvara <guilabel>Pronađi</guilabel> dijalog "
"koji traga ga konkretnim tekstom među podacima u bazi podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1118
#, no-c-format
msgid "The External Data Tab"
msgstr "Kartica vanjskih podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the External Data Tab you can you can import data from other sources "
"into your &kexi; project."
msgstr ""
"Iz kartice vanjskih podataka možete uvoziti podatke s ostalih izvora u vaš "
"&kexi; projekat."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Import Data From File"
msgstr "Uvezite podatke iz datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Import Data From File</guilabel>, displays a dialog that allows "
"you to import data from CSV or plain text files to a new table in your "
"project."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uvezi podatke iz datoteke</guilabel> prikazuje dijalog koji "
"omogućava uvoz podataka iz CSV(vrijednosti odvojene zarezom) ili običnog "
"teksta u tabela vašeg projekta."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Import Tables"
msgstr "Umetanje tabele"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Import Tables</guilabel>, opens the <guilabel>Table Importing "
"Wizard</guilabel> that allows you to import data either from a "
"<filename>fods</filename>, <filename>mdb</filename>, <filename>ods</"
"filename>, <filename>tsv</filename> file or from another database server, to "
"a new table in your project."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Umetanje tabele</guilabel>, otvara <guilabel>Čarobnjak uvoza "
"tabela</guilabel> koji omogućava uvoz podataka bilo iz datoteka "
"<filename>fods</filename>, <filename>mdb</filename>, <filename>ods</"
"filename>, <filename>tsv</filename> ili iz drugog servera baza podataka, u "
"novu tabelu vašeg projekta."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Export Data to File"
msgstr "Izvoz podataka u datoteku"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Export Data to File</guilabel>, displays a dialog that allows you "
"to export the current tables data to a plain text or CSV file."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Izvoz podataka u datoteku</guilabel> prikazuje dijalog koji "
"omogućava izvoz trenutne tabele podataka kao tekst ili CSV datoteku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The table has to be open, in order to be able to export data from it to a "
"file."
msgstr "Za izvoz podataka u datoteku, tabela mora biti otvorena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1154
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Tools Tab"
msgstr "Kartica alata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the <guilabel>Tools</guilabel> tab you can you can manipulate your "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"Kartica <guilabel>Alati</guilabel> vam omogućava kontrolisanje vaših "
"projekata."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compact Database"
msgstr "Kompakcija baze podatake"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Compact Database</guilabel>, checks for minor error in the "
"database and reduces the database's size."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kompakcija baze podataka</guilabel>, provjerava male greške u bazi "
"podataka i smanjuje veličinu baze podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should regularly compact your database to keep it in good shape, "
"especially after extensive records operations (mass add, delete)"
msgstr ""
"Trebali biste vašu kompaktnu bazu podataka čuvati u dobrom stanju, posebno "
"nakon velikih operacija zapisa(mnogo dodavanja, brisanja)"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1187
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Form Design Tab"
msgstr "Kartica dizajniranja obrasca"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the <guilabel>Form Design</guilabel> tab you can you select widgets to "
"add to your form."
msgstr ""
"Iz kartice <guilabel>Dizajn obrasca</guilabel> možete odabrati kontrole koje "
"želite dodati na obrazac."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1204
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer"
msgstr "Pokazivač"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1206
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Pointer</guilabel>, switches to the widget selection mode."
msgstr "<guilabel>Pokazivač</guilabel> prebacuje u mod odabira kontrola."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting any widget, will switch to the widget add mode. Then you can click "
"anywhere on the form to place the widget."
msgstr ""
"Odabir bilo koje kontrole, prebacit će vas u mod dodavanja kontrole. Nakon "
"toga možete kliknuti bilo gdje na obrazac da biste postavili kontrolu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1213 index.docbook:1298
#, no-c-format
msgid "Label"
msgstr "Oznaka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Label</guilabel> widget displays predefined information on a "
"form. Usually it is used as a caption next to other data-aware widgets."
msgstr ""
"Kontrola <guilabel>Oznaka</guilabel> prikazuje predefinisane informacije na "
"obrascu. Obično se koristi za naslov pored neke od kontrola podataka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1218
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text Box"
msgstr "Tekstualni okvir"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Text Box</guilabel> is a single line container for data "
"contained in your table."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tekstualni okvir</guilabel> je jednolinijski kontejner podataka "
"sadržan u vašoj tabeli."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1223
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text Editor"
msgstr "Uređivač teksta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1225
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Text Editor</guilabel> is a multiline container for data "
"contained in your table."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uređivač teksta</guilabel> je višelinijski kontejner za podatke "
"sadržan u vašoj tabeli."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1228
#, no-c-format
msgid "Combo Box"
msgstr "Kombo kutija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Combo Box</guilabel> displays a list of options to choose from."
msgstr "<guilabel>Kombo kutija</guilabel> prikazuje listu opcija za odabir."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1233
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check Box"
msgstr "Kutija za oznaku"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Check Box</guilabel> holds two or three states of data (&eg; On/"
"Off)"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kutija za oznaku</guilabel> sadrži dva ili tri stanja (&eg; On/Off)"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Image Box"
msgstr "Kutija slike"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An <guilabel>Image Box</guilabel> holds an image, bound to a field in a "
"table."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kutija slike</guilabel> sadrži sliku, vezanu za polje u tabeli."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1243
#, no-c-format
msgid "Button"
msgstr "Dugme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Button</guilabel> allows you to define actions to be executed "
"upon clicking on it."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Dugne</guilabel> omogućava definiranje akcije koja će se izvršiti "
"nakon klika miša."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1248
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frame"
msgstr "Okvir"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1250
#, no-c-format
msgid "A <guilabel>Frame</guilabel> is used as a container for other widgets."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Okvir</guilabel> je korišten kao kontejner za ostale kontrole."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1253
#, no-c-format
msgid "Group Box"
msgstr "Okvir grupe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Group Box</guilabel> is used to group other widgets and control "
"their state."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Okvir grupe</guilabel> se koristi da grupiše ostale kontrole i "
"kontroliše njihovo stanje."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1258
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tab Widget"
msgstr "Kartična kontrola"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Tab Widget</guilabel> is used as a container for other widgets "
"and can have many pages that contain different widgets."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kartična kontrola</guilabel> se koristi kao kontejner za ostale "
"kontrole i može imati mnogo stranica koje sadrže različite kontrole."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1263 index.docbook:1323
#, no-c-format
msgid "Line"
msgstr "Linija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1265 index.docbook:1325
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Line</guilabel> is used as a logical separator between different "
"parts of a form."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Linija</guilabel> se koristi kao rastavljač(separator) između "
"različitih dijelova obrasca."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1268
#, no-c-format
msgid "Web Browser"
msgstr "Web preglednik"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Web Browser</guilabel> is a widget that allows to display a web "
"page inside the form."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Web preglednik</guilabel> je kontrola koja omogućava prikaz web "
"stranica unutar obrasca."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1274
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assign Action"
msgstr "Dodijeli akciju"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Assign Action</guilabel> is used to assign an action to be "
"executed when an event occurs (&eg; clicking on a button)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Dodijeli akciju</guilabel> se koristi za dodjelu akcije koja se "
"izvršava po nekom događaju (&eg; klikom na dugme miša)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1281
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Report Design Tab"
msgstr "Kartica izvještaja dizajna"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1295
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the <guilabel>Report Design</guilabel> tab you can you select widgets "
"to add to your report."
msgstr ""
"Iz kartice <guilabel>Kartica izvještaja dizajna</guilabel> možete odabrati "
"kontrole koje žečite dodati u vašem izvještaju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Label</guilabel> widget displays predefined information on a "
"report. Usually it is used as a caption next to other data-aware widgets."
msgstr ""
"Kontrola <guilabel>Oznaka</guilabel> služi za prikaz predefinisanih "
"informacija o izvještaju. Obično se koristi kao naslov za ostale kontrole "
"podataka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1303
#, no-c-format
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Polje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1305
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Field</guilabel> widget is a single line container for data "
"contained in your table."
msgstr ""
"Kontrola <guilabel>Polje</guilabel> je jednolinijski kontejner za podatke "
"sadržane u vašoj tabeli."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1308
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Text</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Tekst</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1310
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Text</guilabel> widget is a multi line container for data "
"contained in your table."
msgstr ""
"Kontrola <guilabel>Tekst</guilabel> je višelinijski kontejner za podatke "
"sadržanje u vašoj tabeli."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1313
#, no-c-format
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Slika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1315
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An <guilabel>Image</guilabel> widget holds an image, bound to a field in a "
"table."
msgstr ""
"Kontrola <guilabel>Slika</guilabel> sadrži sliku, vezanu za polje u tabeli."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1318
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check"
msgstr "Provjeri"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1320
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Check</guilabel> widget holds two or three states of data (&eg; "
"On/Off)"
msgstr ""
"Kontrola <guilabel>Provjeri</guilabel> pamti dva ili tri stanja podataka "
"(&eg; On/Off)"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:1335
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chart"
msgstr "Grafik"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Chart</guilabel> widget is used to add a visual representation "
"of your data presented on a graph."
msgstr ""
"Kontrola <guilabel>Grafik</guilabel> se koristi kao vizuelni prikaz vaših "
"podataka prezentiran pomoću grafika."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:1340
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>Web</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis>Mreža</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1342
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Web</guilabel> widget is used to provide a minimal web browser "
"component and print information from a local or web site on a report."
msgstr ""
"Kontrola <guilabel>Mreža</guilabel> se koristi kao najjednostavnija "
"komponenta web preglednika i služi za printanje lokalnih ili informacija sa "
"web stranice u izvještaju."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:1346
#, no-c-format
msgid "Barcode"
msgstr "Barkod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Barcode</guilabel> widget is used to create a barcode to be "
"printed on a report, from data held in a field."
msgstr ""
"Kontrola <guilabel>Barkod</guilabel> se koristi za kreiranje barkoda podatka "
"u polju, koji će biti isprintan na izvještaju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Appendix A. Introduction to Databases"
msgstr "Dodatak A. Uvod u baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1356
#, no-c-format
msgid "<link linkend=\"what-is-a-database\">What Is a Database?</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"what-is-a-database\">Šta je baza podataka?</link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"database-and-spreadsheet\">Database and Spreadsheet</"
"link>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"database-and-spreadsheet\">Baze podataka i tabelarni prikaz</"
"link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1358
#, no-c-format
msgid "<link linkend=\"database-design\">Database Design</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr "<link linkend=\"database-design\">Dizajn baze podataka</link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"who-needs-a-database\">Who Needs a Database?</link>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"who-needs-a-database\">Kome treba baza podataka?</link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"database-creation-software\">Database Creation Software</"
"link>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"database-creation-software\">Softver za kreiranje baza "
"podataka</link>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1362
#, no-c-format
msgid "What Is a Database?"
msgstr "Šta je baza podataka?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1363
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can define a database as a collection of data on one topic. It is "
"organised in a way allowing to easily browse the information, make changes "
"or add new items."
msgstr ""
"Bazu podataka možemo definisati kao kolekciju podataka vezanih za jednu "
"temu. Organizovana je tako da dopušta veoma brzu i jednostavnu pretragu, "
"dodavanje ili brisanje informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1365
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Look at this diagram for one of the above examples: a simple phone book."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte ovaj dijagram za jedan od prethodnih primjera: jednostavni "
"telefonski imenik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1382
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The above picture shows a set of two contacts each of which is presented on "
"a separate card. It appears that such a card can constitute a single row in "
"a table:"
msgstr ""
"Slika iznad pokazuje dva kontakta od kojih su oba na različitoj kartici. "
"Izgleda da takva kartica može sačinjavati jedan red u tabeli:"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:1386 index.docbook:1437
#, no-c-format
msgid "Contacts table"
msgstr "Tabela kontakata"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1390 index.docbook:1572 index.docbook:1657
#, no-c-format
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Ime"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1391
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tel No."
msgstr "Broj telefona."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1397 index.docbook:1582 index.docbook:1668
#, no-c-format
msgid "Joan"
msgstr "Joan"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1400 index.docbook:1452
#, no-c-format
msgid "699 23 43 12"
msgstr "699 24 43 12"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1405 index.docbook:1599 index.docbook:1688
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adam"
msgstr "Adam"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1408 index.docbook:1463
#, no-c-format
msgid "711 19 77 21"
msgstr "711 19 77 21"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1414
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Terms and definitions: A single data which constitutes a part of a greater "
"collection can be called a <emphasis>row</emphasis> or more professionally a "
"<emphasis>record</emphasis>. The collection is normally called a "
"<emphasis>table</emphasis>. Moreover, the most natural name for the table is "
"one describing the data it offers/stores which is Contacts. Furthermore, "
"each row in the table consists of columns often also called "
"<emphasis>fields</emphasis>. In the table <replaceable>Contacts</"
"replaceable> there are two columns (fields): <guilabel>Name</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Tel No.</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Usovi i definicije: Podatak koji sačinjava dio veće kolekcije možemo "
"nazvati<emphasis>red</emphasis> ili profesionalnije <emphasis>zapis</"
"emphasis>. Kolekcija se najčešće naziva <emphasis>tabela</emphasis>. "
"Najprirodnije ime za tabelu jeste ono koje opisuje podatke koje ona nudi/"
"sadrži a to su Kontakti. Nadalje, svaki red u tabeli sačinjen je od kolona, "
"obično zvanih <emphasis>polja</emphasis>. U tabeli <replaceable>Kontakti</"
"replaceable> postoje dvije kolone(polja): <guilabel>Ime</guilabel> i "
"<guilabel>Broj telefona</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1416
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For simple uses a single table can make up a database. Many people consider "
"these two equivalent. As you will see, for real databases we usually need "
"more than one table."
msgstr ""
"Za jednostavne upotrebe, jedna jedina tabela može činiti bazu podataka. "
"Mnogi ljudi misle da su tabele i baze podataka ekvivalentne. Kao što ćete "
"vidjeti u nastavku, za prave baze podataka obično vam treba više od jedne "
"tabele."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To sum up, you have already got a simple database with one table "
"<replaceable>Contacts</replaceable>."
msgstr ""
"Da zaključimo, već imate jednu jednostavnu bazu podataka sa jednom tabelom "
"<replaceable>Kontakti</replaceable>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check content at <ulink url=\"https://www.zoho.com/creator/database-software-"
"vs-spreadsheet.html\"></ulink>"
msgstr ""
"Pogledate sadržaj na <ulink url=\"https://www.zoho.com/creator/database-"
"software-vs-spreadsheet.html\"></ulink>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1423
#, no-c-format
msgid "Database and Spreadsheet"
msgstr "Baze podataka i tabelarni prikaz"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1424
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is very likely that you have already used spreadsheet applications like "
"<guilabel>Calligra Sheets</guilabel>, <guilabel>LibreOffice Calc</guilabel> "
"or <application>&Microsoft; Excel</application>. If so, you will probably "
"wonder: since both spreadsheets and databases have tables, why should I use "
"the latter?"
msgstr ""
"Veoma je moguće da ste do sada koristi tabelarni prikaz u aplikacijama kao "
"što je <guilabel>Calligra Sheets</guilabel>, <guilabel>LibreOffice Calc</"
"guilabel> ili <application>&Microsoft; Excel</application>.  Ukoliko jeste, "
"vjerovatno ćete se zapitati: kad već i tabelarni prikaz i baze podataka "
"posjeduju tabele, zašto bi trebali koristiti ovaj drugi?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While comparing spreadsheets and databases you may encounter the following "
"issues which you will later see in greater detail."
msgstr ""
"U toku poređenja tabelarnog prikaza i baze podataka možda ćete naići na "
"sljedeće probleme s kojima ćete se kasnije dobro upoznati."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1428
#, no-c-format
msgid "How Is a Database Different From a Spreadsheet?"
msgstr "Na koji je način baza podataka drukčija od tabelarnog prikaza?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Gradually exceeding the capacity of a mobile phone, expand your table "
"<replaceable>Contacts</replaceable> adding a column (field) "
"<replaceable>Address</replaceable>. Add more telephone numbers (office, "
"home) for each person and add surnames to names. To make it simpler we "
"assume the following:"
msgstr ""
"Postepeno povećavajte kapacitet telefona, proširite tabelu  "
"<replaceable>Kontakti</replaceable> dodajući kolonu(polje)  "
"<replaceable>Adresa</replaceable>. Dodajte još telefonskih brojeva(kućni, "
"poslovni) za svaku osobu te također unesite i prezimena. Da pojednostavimo, "
"pretpostavimo sljedeće:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The table is limited to two people (obviously, there could be hundreds and "
"thousands of them in a real database)"
msgstr ""
"Tabela je ograničena na dvije osobe(očigledno, moguće ih je imati na stotine "
"ili hiljade u stvarnim bazama podataka)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1433
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are no two persons with the same name and surname"
msgstr "Ne postoje dvije osobe s istim imenom i prezimenom"

#. Tag: guilabel
